  <para style="h">Aromayi</para>
  <para style="toc1">Aromayi</para>
  <para style="toc2">Aromayi</para>
  <para style="toc3">Aro</para>
  <para style="mt1">Aromayi</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ROM 1" />
  <para style="po">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 1:1" />Bwulus, Kirisiti Yeisu tnutnuyi, n a ɓə yi wo, nabai waa zhni tnutnuloyi jesnu n knyignyi ntu Shekwoyi nabagyi manai ɓo; <verse eid="ROM 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 1:2" />nabagyi manai n Shekwoyi ɓə la əkwo ɓəgbeshi tunyi n sapa nyi, kwo ɓə kwnu ń əwo sheaɓəgwognayi agbe nu, dna ń Nyakazhi Gyigyiyi. <verse eid="ROM 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 1:3" />Nabagyi manai ye ntu əwo Nugwnu ɓo nu, əza ń a ɓə ma wo vyi zanyikwoci ofye, wo ɓə zhni Dawuda yawyi nu, <verse eid="ROM 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 1:4" />ama dna ń gyigyi əfye Zafnu nya, a ɓə la wo knyignyi Shekwoyi Nugwnu dna n kalá əwo kalala nya n əfyi: Yeisu Kirisiti əyi Dagayi. <verse eid="ROM 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 1:5" />Dna n əwo nu, ń yi la shebmyashi gwo ɓədo ń atnutnuloyi-zhnizhnii, nabai ya yi Abyedo vnyanya ɓa vyi gbetu n kwo gbmiɓe n gaiciyaganunui ntu əwo əye ɓo. <verse eid="ROM 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 1:6" />Əfyehni ce fye fyilo ń Abyedo, ń a la ɓa yi ge ɓa kwu zhni Yeisu Kirisiti anya nyi.<verse eid="ROM 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="po">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 1:7" />Nyakashi ye, kwo lo da aza nu vnyanya n ɓa fyilo ń Roma, ń Shekwoyi ye ɓa lo jesnu n a la ɓa yi ɓa kwu zè əwo aza agyigyiyi.</para>
  <para style="po" vid="ROM 1:7">Shebmyashi n bwugbafui ɓa ɓe da fye, n ɓa kwnu n Shekwoyi əyi Dada aba ɓədo n Dagayi Yeisu Kirisitii.<verse eid="ROM 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bwulus pwawo wa lo gnaɓyi n Roma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 1:8" />Kpmisnui, mi sa Shekwoyi ami lo dna n Yeisu Kirisiti ntu əfye ɓo vnyanya, ntuge a da əfye gaiciyaganunui əɓo lo vnyanya fyi ń anyì. <verse eid="ROM 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 1:9" />Shekwoyi, ń mi zhni əwo tnutnu dna ń əmi zafnu dna n waazizhni, əwo Nugwnu nabagyi manai nya. Əwo nu zhni əmi ɓəgbmiyi, she mi pá əfye ɓo lo ciici <verse eid="ROM 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 1:10" />dna ń əmi aduwazhni nsahosahoi vnyanya. Mi zhniaduwa lo ge nsaiye n kpmasnu dna ń Shekwoyi ɓəye, ń zokwo ɓa gwuya ga mi ma ɓe əfye aba.<verse eid="ROM 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 1:11" />A wo mi əpwa lo nge ma ɓe əfye aba ma gye fye əwye nabai ma ga fye zafnu anyaga ho, fya ɓwa kalá; <verse eid="ROM 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 1:12" />əkwo nu nyi nge, əfye ɓədo əmii, ń yi ɓa myiaje gaiciyaganunui zhi n kwnusnu. <verse eid="ROM 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 1:13" />Əmi azaje, azanugbai n anyikwozai, mi to ncei pmalo fya kwu zhi n ɓəyeɓwui m, ntuge mi ɓə la əmihni ye aɓwa bəgyé ma ɓe əfye aba (ama to ai ye mi ge mi ɓe m, nya nsaiye) nabai n mi ɓa myi ma ɓwa avyiyi aje fyi n əfye aza cè, n ɓwasnu she mi kwu ɓwa fyi n Abyedo aje nyi.<verse eid="ROM 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 1:14" />Kwo n mii zhni ɓəshishi nu n Agirikiyi aba ɓədo ntna Agirikiyii, jesnu ń aza acecei aba n amamai. <verse eid="ROM 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 1:15" />Cenuzhni minyi nunui gnyi n əpwawoi ma zhni nabagyi manai waazi ga əfye ce, ń fye fyi ń Roma nyi.<verse eid="ROM 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 1:16" />Nabagyi manai vnyinkwo ta wo mi lo m, ntuge əkwo nu zhni Shekwoyi kalá n kwo ɓe n gnyignyii n zahozahoyi aba n wo ga gaiciya: kpmisnui n Yahudiyi aba, nlonu lo da Abyedo. <verse eid="ROM 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 1:17" />Ntuge dna ń nabagyi manai nu ń a la Shekwoyi ɓəfyecezhni kpeyawu; ɓəfyecezhni ń a zhni kwo dna ń gaiciyaganunui, n kwo ya n kpmisnui kwoi lo kpmasnui, n ɓwasnu she a ncei kafyilo: “Ɓəfyecezhniyi ɓa gyianyì n gaiciyaganunui.”<verse eid="ROM 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Shekwoyi minagyi napyei tu n aleifyizhniyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 1:18" />Shekwoyi minagyi napyei gnyilo kwoi kpeyawu ɓe ń əshemi tu aza atnashekwoyi adnawoi tukwo ɓədo ǹ akpízhniyii vnyanya ń ɓa ce gaiciyanunui aɓwaya ntu əɓa kpízhni ɓo. <verse eid="ROM 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 1:19" />Shikwonyi əɓo ń a ɓa myi a kpeye ntu Shekwoyi ɓo, kwo wulo pəipəi ń əɓa aba, ntuge Shekwoyi wo kwu kwo wu ɓa pəipəi. <verse eid="ROM 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 1:20" />Ntuge tunyi n anyì zhnizhni əsa, Shekwoyi alu manai ń a ta gye ɓa awye nyi m; əwo kalá nyalonyalo nya, n əwo alu ikwo vnyanya nyai; a kwu ɓa gyewye pəipəi, jesnu ai ɓwa əɓa awyega ń anya ń a kwu zhni nyi, ntulonu aza to n aɓoɓwashi lo m.<verse eid="ROM 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 1:21" />Ntuge kwo shikwonyi ɓa ɓə kpe Shekwoyi əye, ɓa to ɓə la wo tu ngye Shekwoyi kwo ɓa sa wo ami m, ama əɓa aɓənubwozhni ɓa kwu gbmiaje jesnu əɓa amama abwugba ɓa kwu fyi wyegbma. <verse eid="ROM 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 1:22" />Kwo shikwonyi ɓa ɓə yi ɓahni ge ɓa cecei lo, ɓa kwu zè amama. <verse eid="ROM 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 1:23" />Jesnu ɓa shna Shekwoyi latu do n anyadogbei ń a ɓə zhni ɓa n wu ngye zanyikwoci n wo fyí nyi, n alui, ń anyafwanyai jesnu ń anyai n ɓa kwó n nubwoi nyi.<verse eid="ROM 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 1:24" />Ntucenu Shekwoyi wa kwu əɓa aleifyi ɓəpwawo, ajewna tnagyii nya, fa fyi ń əɓa adu, ntu əɓa anayi àɓyii-kwnuya əɓo n ajei. <verse eid="ROM 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 1:25" />Ɓa shna Shekwoyi gaiciyanunui ədo n akatái, jesnu ɓa ga anya azhnizhniyi mwamwa, ɓa zhni ɓa tnutnu, ɓa fa Shekwoyi anya vnyanya zhniyi, əwo nu n a ci wo nyalonyalo nyi. Amyi.<verse eid="ROM 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 1:26" />Ntu dəye ɓo, Shekwoyi wa kwu ɓa ga fyi n gyewna pwawo avnyinkwo nya. Kwo əɓa anyikwo ɓa shna gyewna ofye do ń adoi ń ɓa to fyilo n ofye m. <verse eid="ROM 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 1:27" />Ń ɓwajesnu lonu, azanugbai ce, ɓa kwu fa gyewna ɓo n anyikwozai dna ń ofye, ɓa kwu nú zhi n gyewna pwawoi n azanugbai ajei. Azanugbai ɓa zhni avnyinkwo aɓo n azanugbai ajei. Cenu ɓə zhni ɓa gwo tata n kwo ɓə gwogwo n ɓai ntu əɓa abaɓwi ɓo.<verse eid="ROM 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 1:28" />Tu n dəye əshe, n ɓwasnu shi ɓa to ɓə gye kwo kwnuce lo ɓa kwu Shekwoyi yekpé wnafyi m, ntulonu Shekwoyi wa kwu ɓa fa fyi ń bwugba ajegbmii, nabai ɓa zhni əɓo n kwo to gwo ɓa zhni m. <verse eid="ROM 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 1:29" />Ɓa kwu nu zhi n əkpizhni dəhodəhoi, n əɓo nukwoi, n fnanai ɓədo n ajegbmii. Ɓa nunui lo n shewoi, zawu, anyàwu, kwocedna, ɓədo n aɓəshinmì n ajei ń bwugba. Ɓa zhni aɓəshnayi nu, <verse eid="ROM 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 1:30" />agnagbazhniyi, Shekwoyi anuwnuyi, asnusnuikpe, atukwognanakwoi jesnu agbegyiyi; ɓai kpe azokwo awoiwoyi aɓo nukwoi zhni nya; ɓai znu əɓa azamayi ɓəgbetu gna; <verse eid="ROM 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 1:31" />ɓa to n gənyikpei lo m, gbenu to lo m, yeye to lo m, snusnugye to lo m. <verse eid="ROM 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 1:32" />Kwo shikwonyi ɓa kpe Shekwoyi gbetu ɓəfyece nya əye lo, nge aza yi ń ɓa zhni aɓo ye ɓa gwo ɓa fyí, ɓa ta ɓwa gwogwodu nu n aɓo ye zhnii m, ama ɓai tuɓwa, n aɓo n aza yi zhni nyi.<verse eid="ROM 1:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ROM 2" />
  <para style="s1">Shekwoyi owada ɓəfyece nya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 2:1" />Ntucenu, ho to n agbmakwnui lo m, əho ń ho da əzado owa lo nyi m, ntuge abahobahoi ń ha da zado owa, ho znu əhohni əknyi nu, ntuge əho ń ho da zado owa nyi, ho zhni aɓo ye pya nu cè n hohni. <verse eid="ROM 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 2:2" />Nsaiye yi kpəlo nge Shekwoyi owada ń kwo tu n aza yi tukwo ń ɓa zhni aɓo ye pya nyi, kwo vyi gaiciyanunui nu. <verse eid="ROM 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 2:3" />Ntulonu, əsa ń əho zanyikwoci azanga, ho da azaje owa jesnu hoi dudu hoi zhni aɓo ye pya ce, ho zhninubwo nge ho ɓə la pwo Shekwoyi owada nuu? <verse eid="ROM 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 2:4" />Kwo ho ci əwo yeye yaakwo wyegba nu, əwo əmìɓwa n bwugbaɓwai, to hoi kpe nge Shekwoyi bwugbaɓwa kwo gwo kwa zhni ho ha yeabwi nu ma a?<verse eid="ROM 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 2:5" />Ama ntu əho bwugba akalákpe ɓo ɓədo n əho ədu tna-abwuye nyai, ho gnyi hoi ye minagyi napyei zhi əhohni nu, ntu nyipyei Shekwoyi minagyi nya ɓo; əwyi n əwo owada ɓəfyece nya ɓə kpeyawu ncei. <verse eid="ROM 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 2:6" />Shekwoyi “ɓə ga zahozahoyi əwo gyiba vyi əɓo nu n wo kwu zhni nyi.” <verse eid="ROM 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 2:7" />Aza yi n ɓa kwu gyima ɓəzhni manai ɓai zna latu shni, mwamwai n wyewyeyi tnafyii, ɓa ɓə ɓwa wyewyeyi nyalonyalo nya. <verse eid="ROM 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 2:8" />Ama tu ń aza yi tukwo ń ɓa zna əɓahni ɓəye nu shni, jesnu n ɓa ná gaiciyanunui aɓo, ɓai vyi aɓo nukwoi, ɓa ɓə ɓwa minagyi napyei ɓədo ǹ minagyii. <verse eid="ROM 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 2:9" />Zahozahoyi n wo zhni aɓo nukwoi, wo ɓə ɓwa azhnìgye n agwunyaznui: kpmisnui ntu Yahudiyi ɓo, nlonu ntu Abyedo ɓo. <verse eid="ROM 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 2:10" />Ama latu, mwamwa n bwugbafui ntu əzahozahoyi ɓo n wo zhni əɓo manai: kpmisnui ntu Yahudiyi ɓo, nlonu ntu Abyedo ɓo. <verse eid="ROM 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 2:11" />Ntuge Shekwoyi ta wu aza bmyashi woi tnu-tnu nu m.<verse eid="ROM 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 2:12" />Aza vnyanya n ɓa ɓə zhni leifyi ntna owa yekpé, ɓa ɓə fyí ntna Mwusa owa, ama aza vnyanya n ɓa ɓə zhni leifyi fyí n Mwusa owa yekpé, a ɓə da ɓa owa n Mwusa owai nu. <verse eid="ROM 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 2:13" />Ntuge aza yi nù to n ɓa wo owa nyawu fyi n atnubwa n ɓa zhni aɓəfyeceyi n Shekwoyi awyeba m, ama aza yi nu n ɓa shi owa ɓwa nyi, ń a ɓə yi ɓa nge aɓəfyeceyi. <verse eid="ROM 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 2:14" />(Ɓəhnihnii, əsa n Abyedo, n ɓa to n owai lo ɓai vyi nyi m, n ɓa zhni əɓo n owa ncei cekpe, kwo la ɓa zè owa ga əɓahni, kwo shikwonyi ɓa to n owai lo m. <verse eid="ROM 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 2:15" />Ɓa wu nge ənya n owa ncei cekpe nge a shiɓwa, kwo kafyilo ń əɓa adu, əɓa atukwovnyi ce n zhni əɓa aɓəgbmiyi, jesnu nsahoi əɓa ɓənubwozhni ɓai ma ɓa aɓo, jesnu n asajei, ɓai bma ɓa.) <verse eid="ROM 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 2:16" />Dəye ɓə zhni n əwyi nu ń Shekwoyi ɓə da aza əɓa aɓo asosoi owa ncei, ntu əɓa aɓo nukwoi zhni ɓo dna n Yeisu Kirisiti, ngye she əmi nabagyi manai da lo nyi.<verse eid="ROM 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ayahudiyi n owai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 2:17" />Nsaiye əho, ń ho yi əhohni nge Yahudiyi nyi; ndəi n ho kpema lo ń owa jesnu hoi gyigbe n Shekwoyii; <verse eid="ROM 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 2:18" />ngye ho kpé əwo ɓəye əye lo jesnu hoi tuɓwa n aɓətnu n ɓa gnabmya; ntuge a kwu owa wu ho; <verse eid="ROM 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 2:19" />ngye kwo la ho kwnuawye, nge ho zhni awyebwayi zokwowuyi nu, awyegbmada bwuznagna; <verse eid="ROM 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 2:20" />amama aɓəgbegayi, aɓyipwutu nyawuyii ntuge dna ń owa, ho n ɓəyekpei lo n gaiciyanunui; <verse eid="ROM 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 2:21" />əho, ń ho ga azaje nyawu nyi, ho ta wu əhohni lo m? Əho ń ho zhni waazi tu əvyiwyi ɓo, ho wyivyi lo? <verse eid="ROM 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 2:22" />Əho ń ho gna aza nge ɓa to zhni anagbái nyi m, ho zhni anagbái lo? Əho ń ho wnunu n ashnai nyi, kwo ho wyivyi lo dna n Dagayipwuwa? <verse eid="ROM 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 2:23" />Əho n ho gyigbe n owai nyi, kwo ho dna Shekwoyi vnyinkwo lo n owa gnanaznui a? <verse eid="ROM 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 2:24" />Ngye she a cei kafyilo: “A da Shekwoyi əye atukwopmi ɓo lo fyi ń Abyedo ntu əfye ɓo.”<verse eid="ROM 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 2:25" />Nyaznu n apmai lo, ń fya shi owa əɓwa, ama ń fya znu owa gnana, fye kwu zè ngye atnanyaznuyi. <verse eid="ROM 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 2:26" />Ntulonu nsaiye, aza yi ń ɓa to n nyaznui lo m, ń ɓa zhni əɓo ń owa ncei da nge a zhni, a taa gye ɓa əwye ngye anyaznuyi nu m? <verse eid="ROM 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 2:27" />Əza ń wo to n ənyai znuznui lo ń nayi m, ama wo shi owa nyawu əɓwa lo, wo ɓə znu ho əknyi, kwo shikwonyi ho n owa kakayii shi lo, n ənyai znuznui, ho zhni owa gnanaznui nu.<verse eid="ROM 2:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 2:28" />Əza to zhni Yahudiyi nu ntuge a ma wo dna n nayi dna n Ayahudiyi m, kwo nge nyaznu ɓwasnu n əbmyi nu n nayi m. <verse eid="ROM 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 2:29" />Aawo, əza zhni Yahudiyi dna ń əmì nù jesnu nyaznu zhni nyaznu ədu nya nu, n Zafnu nu naa zhni, toge owa kakai n aɓwai m. Əza yi pya cici kwo ta gbmi n azaje aba nu m, ama ń Shekwoyi aba.<verse eid="ROM 2:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ROM 3" />
  <para style="s1">Shekwoyi gaiciyazhninunu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 3:1" />To, əza n wo zhni Yahudiyi, wo gnabmyagnyi lo n wunanu a? Kwo nyaznu n knyi apmai nu lo a? <verse eid="ROM 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 3:2" />Gnabmyagnyi lo n mwa kwokwo dna n səpa dəhodəhoi! Kpmisnui, Ayahudiyi nu n a kwu Shekwoyi aɓədagbma fnyi ɓa əɓwa nyi.<verse eid="ROM 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 3:3" />To, ngye azaho ɓə zhni atna-ɓəgbenuyi nu ma a? Əɓa tnagbenunu ɓo ɓa wnu Shekwoyi gaiciyazhninunu ya? <verse eid="ROM 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 3:4" />Kwo taa yezhni m, kpeekpe! Fa Shekwoyi waa zhni gaiciya, ń kasnu zanyikwoci dəhodəhoi waa zhni katayi, ngye she kwo kafyilo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:4">“Nabai ń a ɓa wu nge ho zhni gaiciya nu əsa n ha daɓo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:4">jesnu haa knyitu n əsa n ha da owa ncei.”<verse eid="ROM 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 3:5" />Ama ngye əyi tnaɓəfyecezhni gbmi Shekwoyi ɓəfyecezhni ɓe lo ncei pəipəi, to, yi ɓa gna dəye ɓo nge nanu a? Nge Shekwoyi zhni tnagaiciyazhniyi nu, n wo ɓe n əwo minagyii napyei kpe n yi nyi? (Mi zhni apma n zanyikwoci ɓənubwozhnii nu.) <verse eid="ROM 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 3:6" />Ɓəhnihni kwo to lo nlonu m! Kwo ɓə gna kwo wulo nlonu, Shekwoyi ɓə da anyì owa n wuna a? <verse eid="ROM 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 3:7" />Əzaho ɓá myi wa gna ge, “Ngye əmi tnagaiciyazhni bma Shekwoyi gaiciyazhninunu lo, jesnu kwoi ɓe n əwo latui, knyiyi nu zhni ai ye n mii znuknyi nge mi zhni leifyizhniyi a?” <verse eid="ROM 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 3:8" />Knyiyi nu zhni ɓanyi taa da she azaho ci yi aɓəcici nge yi gna, “Fa ya zhni əɓo nukwoi nu nabai əɓo manai kwa gbmiɓe a?” Əɓa knyiznu kwnuce lo!<verse eid="ROM 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɓəfyeceyi to lo m</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 3:9" />To, yi ɓa zo ɓəye zhi nge nanu a? Yi gnabmyazhi lo nu? Aawo! Ntuge yi la əɓo luznutu nge Ayahudiyi n Abyedoyii vnyanya ɓa wulo ngye aje nu, ɓa fyilo ń aleifyi kalá snuta. <verse eid="ROM 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 3:10" />Ngye she kwo kafyilo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:10">“Əza gbmanyi ho to lo n wo zhni ɓəfyeceyi m, kwo gbmanyikaka;<verse eid="ROM 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 3:11" />əzaho to lo n wo n awyegai lo m,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:11">Əza to lo gbmanyi ń wo zna Shekwoyi shni m.<verse eid="ROM 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 3:12" />Aza vnyanya ɓa la awye pmyiya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:12">əɓa vnyanya ń kwnusnu ɓa kwu zè azagbəlo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:12">əza to lo ń wo zhni əɓo manai lo m,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:12">kwo zaknayi.”<verse eid="ROM 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 3:13" />“Əɓa ashaɓwo zhni avnyigwo nu n gwuya zhi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:13">əɓa anyitala n kwocednai shiɓwa.”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:13">“Əmwi ogbma-owa nya nu fyi n əɓa agbe.”<verse eid="ROM 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 3:14" />“Əɓa agbe nunui lo n aknyikpei n bwugbalilii.”<verse eid="ROM 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 3:15" />“Əɓa apita n pyepyei ntuge ɓa zè amiya;<verse eid="ROM 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 3:16" />agbmazhni n əsnai nu fyi n əɓa azokwo,<verse eid="ROM 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 3:17" />jesnu zokwo bwugbafu nya ɓa ta kpe kwo əye m.”<verse eid="ROM 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 3:18" />“Shekwoyi dnawo to lo n əɓa awyeba m kpeekpe.”<verse eid="ROM 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 3:19" />Nsaiye yi kpəlo nge ɓəhoɓəhoi n owa ncei da lo, kwo daɓo n aza yii nu n ɓa fyi n owa snuta, nabai n əgbe dəhodəhoi kwaa cepyi jesnu anyì vnyanya ɓa ɓe n anyadokwui n Shekwoyi aba. <verse eid="ROM 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 3:20" />Ntucenu a to ɓə yi zahozahoyi nge ɓəfyeceyi n əwo awyeba ntu ń owa ɓwashi ɓo m; ama kwo snusnu nu nge, dna n owa, yi n ɓəpai lo ntu əyi aleifyi ɓo.<verse eid="ROM 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɓəfyecezhni dna n gaiciyaganunui</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 3:21" />Ama nsaiye a kwu Shekwoyi ɓəfyecezhni wu, gbowo n ədoi ń kwo dna ń owa nyi, ədo ń Owa n Sheaɓəgwognayii ɓə la əkwo ɓəgbmi nyi. <verse eid="ROM 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 3:22" />Ɓəfyecezhni ye n kwo gbmi ń Shekwoyi nyi, kwo ɓe dna n gaiciyaganunui dna ń Yeisu Kirisiti, ga aza vnyanya n ɓa kwu gaiciya ga. Yahudiyi to kakai lo n Abyedoi m, <verse eid="ROM 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 3:23" />ntuge aza vnyanya ɓa kwu leifyi zhni jesnu ɓanyi kwu gba kpekpegye n Shekwoyi latu aba, <verse eid="ROM 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 3:24" />jesnu aza ɓa kwu ɓəgyikpmaya ɓwa n adaada ntu n əwo shebmyashi ɓo, dna n shnashna n kwo ɓə ɓe dna n Kirisiti Yeisui nyi. <verse eid="ROM 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 3:25" />Shekwoyi ɓə ga Kirisiti nu n zhni ɓəkaya nyagbmi, dna n əwo amizeya; a ɓa gwo kwo dna n gaiciyaganunui. Wo ɓə zhni dəye nabai wa wu əwo ɓəfyecezhni nu, ntuge dna n əwo bwugbaɓwa wo ɓə kwu aleifyi fa zhi, n a ɓə zhni ń sapa ntna tatagai. <verse eid="ROM 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 3:26" />Wo ɓə zhni dəye nabai wa wu əwo ɓəfyecezhni nu dna n əsa ye, nabai waa zhni gaiciyada jesnu əza ń wo pmya aza yi n ɓa kwu gaiciyaganunui fyi n Yeisu.<verse eid="ROM 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 3:27" />To, nsaiye, əgbegyiba gnyi n nanu a? A la əkwo əɓwa gbmiya. Ntu n knyi owai ɓo a? Ntu n owa ɓo n kwo ye atnutnu? Aawo, ama ntu n owa ɓo n kwo ye gaiciyaganunui. <verse eid="ROM 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 3:28" />Ntuge yi la gyitu nge əza zhni tna-ɓəgyii nu dna n gaiciyaganunui toge ń atnutnu owa ɓwashi nya m. <verse eid="ROM 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 3:29" />Kwo Shekwoyi wo ɓwa Shekwoyi Ayahudiyi nya nu zhni? Wo to zhni Shekwoyi Abyedo nya nu ce m? Əə, Shekwoyi Abyedo nya ce, <verse eid="ROM 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 3:30" />shikwonyi Shekwoyi n ɓwasnu lo gbmanyi nu, n wo ɓə kpmaɓəgyiya n anyaznuyi dna n gaiciyaganunui ɓədo n atnanyaznuyii jesnu dna n gaiciyaganunui gbmanyigbmanyi. <verse eid="ROM 3:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 3:31" />To, yi ɓaa kwu owa zhniagbma n gaiciyaganunui yei? Kwo to lo nlonu m kpeekpe! N əkwoɓwi, yi ɓa kwu owa shiɓwa.<verse eid="ROM 3:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ROM 4" />
  <para style="s1">A la aɓəma kpma Ibrahim ya dna n gaiciyaganunui</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 4:1" />To, yi ɓa gna ge Ibrahim, əyi zakwoyi, ɓə gye knyiɓei nu əwye ntu ɓəye ɓo a? <verse eid="ROM 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 4:2" />Ngye ɓəhnihni nu ge n atnutnui nu n Ibrahim ɓəi ɓwa ɓəgyikpmaya, akpəge wo n ɓəhoi lo ń wo ɓa gbma ntu kwo ɓo; ama toge gnyi n Shekwoyi abye m. <verse eid="ROM 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 4:3" />Nyakagyigyiyi kwa gna nge nanu a? Nge, “Ibrahim ɓə ga Shekwoyi gaiciya, jesnu aa kwo ba dna wo ge ɓəfyecezhni.” <verse eid="ROM 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 4:4" />Nsaiye, əza n wa zhni tnutnu, a ta gba wo tnutnu gyiwye ngye nyaga nu m, ama a gba wo əta nu. <verse eid="ROM 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 4:5" />Dudulonu, əza ń wo to zhni tnutnu m, ama wa kpema ń Shekwoyi nu, n wo kpma atnashekwoyi dnawoyi aɓoya nyi, a ɓa ba əwo gaiciyaga dna nge ɓəfyecezhni nu. <verse eid="ROM 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 4:6" />Dawuda ɓə da əɓo gbmanyigbmanyi nu əsa ń wo ɓə da anabəlika ɓo ntu əza ń Shekwoyi ba ɓəfyecezhni dna wo, toge ntu tnutnuzhni ɓo m:<verse eid="ROM 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 4:7" />“Anabəlikada nu n aza yii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 4:7">n a kwu əɓa aleifyi zo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 4:7">n a kwu əɓa aleifyi pwuanya,<verse eid="ROM 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 4:8" />Anabəlikada nu n əzai</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 4:8">n Dagayi taa ba əwo leifyi tu n əwo tukwo m, kpeekpe.”<verse eid="ROM 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 4:9" />Anabəlika ɓwa ye, n ɓwasnu lo, tu ń anyaznuyi ɓo nu, kwo n atnanyaznuyii ɓədo a? Yi zhi lo yii da nge Ibrahim gaiciyaga; a ɓə la kwo ba dna wo nge ɓəfyecezhni. <verse eid="ROM 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 4:10" />A ɓə ba kwo dna wo ntu knyiɓei nu a? A ɓə ba kwo dna, ai kwu nyaznu zhni wo nu, kwo to ai zhni wo nyaznu nu ma? <verse eid="ROM 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 4:11" />A ɓə ga wo nyaznu n zhni əznù nu, tuzè ɓəfyecezhni nya, ń wo ɓə kwu zhni dna n gaiciyaga woi ye gnyi n tnanyaznui. Ntulonu nsaiye, əwo nu zhni dada aza vnyanya nya ń ɓa ga gaiciya, ama to ɓai gwo nyaznu m, nabai n a ɓaa ɓəfyecezhni ba fyi ɓa. <verse eid="ROM 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 4:12" />Nlonu, Ibrahim nu zhni anyaznui dada, toge ntu əɓa nyaznu ɓo gbmanyi m, ama ntuge ɓa znazna fyilo ń gaiciyaga apitaɓwi n əyi dada ɓə ncei, ai kpe wo nyaznu nyi.<verse eid="ROM 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 4:13" />Kwo to ɓə nyi nge ntu owa ɓo nu ń Ibrahim ɓədo n əwo aɓyii ɓə gwo ɓəgbeshi, nge wo ɓə la zhni əgwúda anyì nya m, ama dna ń ɓəfyecezhni nu ń kwo ɓe n gaiciyagai nyi. <verse eid="ROM 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 4:14" />Ntuge ngye aza yi n ɓa shi owa ɓwa nyi, əɓa nu zhni əgwúda, a gye gaiciyaga to ye n apmai lo m, jesnu ɓəgbeshi kwo la zhni ənya gbəloi, <verse eid="ROM 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 4:15" />ntuge owa ɓe n minagyi napyeii. Jesnu aba n owa to lo m, aleifyizhni to lo n ɓo m.<verse eid="ROM 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 4:16" />Ntucenu ɓəgbeshi ɓe n gaiciyagai nu, nabai n a ɓa myi a shi kwo dna n shebmyashi jesnu ń a ɓaa əkwo ɓo wnashi ga Ibrahim aɓyi vnyanya; to ɓwasnu ntu aza yi ɓo nu, n ɓa zhni owa nya nyi m, ama ntu aza yi ɓo cè, ń ɓa n Ibrahim gaiciyagai lo. Əwo nu zhni əyi dada vnyanya. <verse eid="ROM 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 4:17" />Ngye shi kwo kafyilo: “Mi la ho zhni dada abye bəgyé nya.” Əwo nu zhni əyi dada ń Shekwoyi awyeba, əza n wo n gaiciyai ga n əwo nu; Shekwoyi n wo ga afyífyiyi wyewyeyi jesnu nyi, woi yi anya ń ɓa to ɓə shnisnusnu m, ɓa kwnuɓe ngye ɓa ɓə shnisnu.<verse eid="ROM 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 4:18" />Aba n awyetu ɓəə kwu ɓwuwye shaasha, Ibrahim dna n awyetu, waa gaiciya ga, ntulonu waa zhni dada abye bəgyé nya, n ɓwasnu she a ɓəə kwu gna wo nyi, “Nlonu ń əho aɓyi ɓə kwu zè.” <verse eid="ROM 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 4:19" />Ntna kalagbagba dna ń əwo gaiciyaga, waa kpetu n kwo, kwo shikwonyi, əwo nayi ɓə gnyi ngye kwo la fyí; shikwonyi wo ɓəə kwu aye ɓwa ngye tagyi, jesnu nge Saratu aɓyimaba ɓə fyífyii ce. <verse eid="ROM 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 4:20" />Dudulonu wo to ɓə shnashna dna ń tnagaiciyaga n ɓəgbeshi n Shekwoyi ɓə shi wo nyi m, ama wa ɓwa kalá dna ń əwo gaiciyaga jesnu woi ga Shekwoyi latu. <verse eid="ROM 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 4:21" />Kwo ɓə n woi kwnuawye kwnukwnui nge Shekwoyi n ikwoi lo wa zhni əɓo n wo ɓəə la shigbe nyi. <verse eid="ROM 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 4:22" />Cenu ɓə zhni “aa kwo ba dna wo nge ɓəfyecezhni.” <verse eid="ROM 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 4:23" />Aɓədagbma, “aa kwo ba dna wo,” to ɓwasnu n əwo gbmanyi ɓo nu m, <verse eid="ROM 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 4:24" />ama ntu əyi ɓo cè, aza n Shekwoyi ɓə kwu yi kwuaje fyi n ɓəfyecezhni; əyi n yi kwu gaiciyaga fyi n wo, ń wo ɓə lá Yeisu əyi Dagayi kala ń əfyi nyi. <verse eid="ROM 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 4:25" />A ɓə la wo taya ga əfyi ntu əyi aleifyi ɓo jesnu a la wo kala n əfyi ntu əyi pmyapmya ɓo.<verse eid="ROM 4:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ROM 5" />
  <para style="s1">Bwugbafu n awyetui</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 5:1" />Ntucenu, shikwonyi yi kwu ɓəgyikpmaya ɓwa dna ń gaiciyaga nyi, yi n bwugbafui lo ń Shekwoyii ntu Dagayi Yeisu Kirisiti ɓo. <verse eid="ROM 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 5:2" />Dna n əwo nu n yi kwu aduba ɓwa n gaiciyagai dna ń shebmyashi n yi kpe gnyi n kwo nu nsaiye nyi. Njesnu yi gbma, yii gyigbe dna ń awyetu Shekwoyi latu nya nu. <verse eid="ROM 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 5:3" />Kwo to ɓwasnu lo nlonu m, ama yi nya agbmada lo ce fyi ń əyi azhnìgye, ntuge yi kpəlo nge azhnìgye ɓe n əmìfyii; <verse eid="ROM 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 5:4" />əmìfyi kwo ɓe n alui; jesnu alu ɓa ɓe n awyetui. <verse eid="ROM 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 5:5" />Njesnu awyetu ta dna yi vnyinkwo m, ntuge Shekwoyi wo la əwo yeye zefyi n əyi adu n Zafnu Gyigyiyii, əza ń a la wo ga yi nyi.<verse eid="ROM 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 5:6" />Fye gyewye, n ɓwasnu n əsai bmyabmya, əsa ń yi ɓə ye zhi n tnakala, Kirisiti wa fyí ntu atnashekwoyi dnawoyi ɓo. <verse eid="ROM 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 5:7" />Kwo dnaɓo lo əzaho wa fyí ntu n ɓəfyeceyi ɓo, kwo shikwonyi əzaho ɓa myi wa ye wa fyí ntu əza manai ɓo. <verse eid="ROM 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 5:8" />Ama Shekwoyi ɓə wu yi əwohni yeye nlai nu: əsa n yi ɓə yee zhni aleifyizhniyi, Kirisiti wa fyí ntu əyi ɓo.<verse eid="ROM 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 5:9" />Shikwonyi yi kwu ɓəgyikpmaya ɓwa nsaiye n əwo amii, wo taa gna yi gnyignyiya nu n Shekwoyi minagyi napyei dna n əwo m! <verse eid="ROM 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 5:10" />Ntuge ngye əsa ń yi ɓə ye zhni Shekwoyi anuwnuyi, a ɓə la yi je yeɓədo n woi ntu əwo Nugwnu əfyi ɓo. To, nsayi, shi a la yi je yeɓədo nyi, yi ɓaa gna gnyignyi ɓwaɓwa nu dna n əwo wyewyeyi! <verse eid="ROM 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 5:11" />Dəye nu to ɓwasnu nlonu m, ama yi je gbma, yii gyigbe dna ń Shekwoyi, ntu n əyi Dagayi Yeisu Kirisiti ɓo, n ya ɓwa yeɓədo nsaiye ntu əwo ɓo nu nyi.<verse eid="ROM 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Əfyi dna n Adamwu jesnu wyewyeyi dna n Kirisiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 5:12" />Ntucenu, n ɓwasnu shi leifyi ɓə loɓe anyi ntu zaknayi ɓo nu, jesnu əfyi kwa ɓe ntu leifyi ɓo nyi; dna ń zokwo ye nu, ń əfyi ɓə ɓe da aza vnyanya, ntuge aza vnyanya ɓə kwu leifyi zhni.<verse eid="ROM 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 5:13" />Ɓəhnihnii kwu kpe nge leifyi ɓə dna n anyì to ai ga owa m. Ama a ta zhni a ba leifyi dna əza aba ń owa to nyi m. <verse eid="ROM 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 5:14" />Dudulonu, əfyi ɓə ya begyi, ənya ń kwo laka ń Adamwu əsa kwoi ɓe Mwusa əsa, kwoi kpe n aza n ɓa to ɓə zhni leifyi n ɓəgbetu gnanaznui, ngye she Adamwu ɓə zhni nyi m. Adamwu nu ɓə zhni ofye, ga əza yi n wo ɓə ɓe nyi.<verse eid="ROM 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 5:15" />Ama nyaga to wu ngye leifyi nu m. Ntuge ngye bəgyé ɓə kwu fyí ntu zaknayi leifyi ɓo, a gye kwo ɓa gna dudu nu Shekwoyi shebmyashi ɓədo n nyagai n kwo ɓe ntu zaknayi shebmyashi ɓo, Yeisu Kirisiti, n kwo ɓa zheya lo aza bəgyé aba! <verse eid="ROM 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 5:16" />Kwo ge a ɓa mwi Shekwoyi nyaga ədo, n əɓoi n kwo ɓə gbmiɓe n zaknayi leifyi nyi m: Owada ɓə vyi leifyi gbmanyi, kwa ɓe n knyiznui, ama nyaga ɓə vyi aleifyi bəgyé kwa ɓe n ɓogyikpmayai. <verse eid="ROM 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 5:17" />Ntuge ngye n zaknayi leifyii nu, n əfyi ɓə gyibe ntu zaknayi yi ɓo, akpəge aza yi n ɓa ɓá gwo Shekwoyi shebmyashi nyaga nunui ɓədo n nyaga ɓəfyecezhni nyai, ɓa ɓá gyibe dna n anyìgyi ntu əza gbmanyi ɓo, Yeisu Kirisiti!<verse eid="ROM 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 5:18" />Ntucenu, ngye shi leifyi gbmanyi ɓə ɓe n knyiznui ga aza vnyanya, ntulonu cè zaknayi ɓəfyecezhni ɓə ɓe n ɓəgyikpmayai jesnu n wyewyeyii ga aza vnyanya. <verse eid="ROM 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 5:19" />Ntuge shi kwo ɓə ɓwasnu ń zaknayi tnaɓəgbetuvyi ɓo nu, ń aza bəgyé ɓə kwu zè aleifyizhniyi nyi, ntulonu cè, n ɓəvyii zaknayi nya nu, n a ɓa kwu bəgyé zè aɓəfyeceyi.<verse eid="ROM 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 5:20" />A ɓə ɓe n owai nabai n leifyi ɓa gna mwamwa nu. Ama aba ń leifyi mwamwaɓe, shebmyashi kwa gna mwamwa nu n du <verse eid="ROM 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 5:21" />nabai n ɓwasnu she leifyi ɓe wnu aɓoya dna ń əfyi, n ɓwajesnu lonu cè ń shebmyashi ɓa zhniaɓo aba ntu ɓəfyecezhni ɓo n kwo ɓe n wyewyeyi nyalonyalo nyai dna ń Yeisu Kirisiti əyi Dagayi.<verse eid="ROM 5:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ROM 6" />
  <para style="s1">Fyífyíyi dna n leifyizhni jesnu wyewyeyi dna n Kirisiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 6:1" />To, nsaiye, yi ɓa da dəye nge nanu a? Yi ɓa gwodu n aleifyizhnii nu nabai Shekwoyi shebmyashi kwa gna mwamwa a? <verse eid="ROM 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 6:2" />Kwo fyewyi! Əyi ń yi ɓə kwu fyí fyi n leifyizhni; kwo ɓa yezhni n wuna ya gwodu dna n anyìgyi leifyizhni nya a? <verse eid="ROM 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 6:3" />Kwo fye ta kpəlo nge əyi vnyanya ń a ɓə zhni yi batizima fyi ń Kirisiti Yeisu nyi, nge a ɓə zhni yi batizima fyi n əwo əfyi nu m? <verse eid="ROM 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 6:4" />Ntucenu, a ɓə kwu yi kwnubyi n woi dna ń batizima lo əfyi, nabai n ɓwasnu ngye she a ɓə lá Kirisiti kala ń əfyi dna ń latu Dada nya nyi, əyihni ce ń yi ɓa myi ya gyianyì wyewyeyi woiwoyi nya.<verse eid="ROM 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 6:5" />Ntuge ngye a ɓə la yi kwnuyeɓədo n woi dna n əwo əfyi nlai, ɓəhnihnii a ɓə la yi kwnuyeɓədo n woi dna ń əwo kala la. <verse eid="ROM 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 6:6" />Ntuge yi kpəlo nge a ɓə la əyi əza kwokwoi kwnu znudu n woi, nabai ń a ɓaa nayi leifyizhni nya əɓo duya, ntuge to ya kwu je leifyi afyenu zhni m; <verse eid="ROM 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 6:7" />ntuge zahozahoyi ń wo la fyí, a la wo gnyi n leifyi.<verse eid="ROM 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 6:8" />Nsaiye ngye yi ɓə kwu kwnu fyí n Kirisitii, yi n gaiciyagai lo nge yi ɓə kwnu anyìgyi n woi. <verse eid="ROM 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 6:9" />Ntuge yi kpəlo nge shi a ɓə la Kirisiti kala ń əfyi nyi, wo taa je fyí m; əfyi to ye n kalái lo tu ń əwo tukwo m. <verse eid="ROM 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 6:10" />Əfyi ń wo ɓə fyí nyi, wo ɓə fyí leifyi əfyi nu znugbmanyi ntu aza vnyanya ɓo; ama anyìgyi ń wo gyi nsaiye nyi, wo gyianyì ga Shekwoyi nu.<verse eid="ROM 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 6:11" />N ɓwajesnu n zokwo ye, fye gye əfyehni n zhni afyífyiyi ń aleifyizhni, ama awyewyeyida ń Shekwoyi, fyi ń Kirisiti Yeisu. <verse eid="ROM 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 6:12" />Ntucenu fye to ye leifyi, nge kwo gyibe, fyi ń əfye anayi n ɓa fyí nyi m, nabai fya vyi əkwo aɓəpwawo nukwoi m. <verse eid="ROM 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 6:13" />Fye to ga aleifyi əfye nayi əga dəhodəhoi kwaa zè əkpí tnutnuzhninya m, fye zezè fya kwu əfyehni ga fyi ń Shekwoyi akwnu nu, ngye aza yi ń a la ɓa kwnuɓe ncei ń əfyi, ɓe wyewyeyi aba; jesnu fya ga wo əfyehni anayi aga ngye ɓəfyece atnutnunya. <verse eid="ROM 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 6:14" />Ntuge leifyi to ɓə ye gwodu kwo ye zhni əfye Dagayi m, ntuge fye to fyi ń owa snuta nu m, ama fyi ń Shekwoyi shebmyashi.<verse eid="ROM 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Afyenu lo aɓəfyecezhni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 6:15" />To, yi zhni n wunanu a? Yi zhni aleifyi nu ntuge yi to fyi n owa snuta nu m, ama fyi ń shebmyashi? Kwo fyewyi! <verse eid="ROM 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 6:16" />Fye ta kpəlo nge əsa ń fya ga əfyehni fyi ń əza akwnu, fyaa vyi əwo gbetu ngye afyenu, fye zhni əza yi afyenu nu, ń fye vyi wo gbetu nyi m; kwo fye kwu zhni leifyi afyenu nu, n kwo lo n azai ń əfyi nyi, kwo afyenu ɓəgbetuvyi nya n kwo lofyi n azai ń ɓəfyecezhni nyi m? <verse eid="ROM 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 6:17" />Ama yi sa Shekwoyi ami lo nge, kwo shikwonyi fye ɓə zhni afyenu nu fyi ń aleifyizhni, fye ɓə kwu vyi gbetu ofye nyawu nya n əfye adui vnyanya, n fye zhi fyei shi kwo əɓwa nyi. <verse eid="ROM 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 6:18" />A la fye gnyi ń leifyi jesnu fye kwu zè afyenu ɓəfyecezhni nya.<verse eid="ROM 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 6:19" />Mi da dəye dna ń zanyikwoci awyega nu, ntu əfye akalágba ɓo fyi ń əfyehni nayi. N ɓwasnu ngye she fye ɓə zhni fyei ga əfye anayi ngye afyenu aɓoajegbmi nya, jesnu fyi ń əkpízhni gna-abye-lolo nya, ntulonu nsaiye fye kwu əfyehni ga fyi ń fyenu ɓəfyecezhni nya kwa ɓe n gyigyii. <verse eid="ROM 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 6:20" />Əsa ń fye ɓə zhni afyenu leifyi nya, fye ɓə kwnukwnuiya n ɓəfyecezhni aknawna. <verse eid="ROM 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 6:21" />Knyi gyibai nu ń fye ɓə ɓwa nsayi, n aɓo, n ɓa wo fye vnyinkwo lo nsaiye nyi a? Aɓəyi ɓə zo n əfyii nu! <verse eid="ROM 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 6:22" />Ama nsaiye, ń a la fye loya n aleifyi jesnu fye nyi kwu zè Shekwoyi afyenu, gyiba n fye ɓwa, kwo lo n fyei n gyigyi nu, jesnu əɓo n kwo gbmiɓe əkwo nu zhni wyewyeyi nyalonyalo nya. <verse eid="ROM 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 6:23" />Ntuge leifyitnutnu tagba nya zhni əfyi nu, ama Shekwoyi nyaga zhni wyewyeyi nyalonyalo nya nu, dna ń Kirisiti Yeisu əyi Dagayi.<verse eid="ROM 6:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ROM 7" />
  <para style="s1">Ɓədogbe ǹ amwulapai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 7:1" />Əmi azaje azanugbai n anyikwozai, kwo fye ta kpəlo m; mi gnyi mii daɓo n azai nu ń ɓa kpe owa əye lo; nge owa n ikwoi ɓwasnu tu ń əza, əsa ń wo ye gnyilo n wyewyeyii nu m? <verse eid="ROM 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 7:2" />Ma ga fye ɓədogbe ye, dna ń owa, aa n nyikwo nuseyii cekpigyido n əwo əɓai, əsa nu ń əwo əɓa ye n wyewyeyii lo nu. Ama ń əwo əɓa wa fyi, a la wo loya ń mwulapa n əwo əɓai. <verse eid="ROM 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 7:3" />Ntulonu nsaiye, ń wa wnagye n zanugbai ədoi, əwo əɓai ye gnyi n wyewyeyii, a yi wo nge nyikwo anagbáizhniyi. Ama ń əwo əɓa wo la fyí, a la wo loya n owa yi, jesnu kwo to zhni anagbáizhni nu ń wa so ənu ədo m.<verse eid="ROM 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 7:4" />Ntulonu, əmi azaje n amapwuyii, əfyehni ce fye ɓə kwu fyí fyi ń owa dna ń Kirisiti nayi, nabai ń fye ɓa kwu zhni əzado nya, əza yi nya ń a ɓə la wo kala ń əfyi nyi, nabai ń fye ɓa myi fya ga gyigyi ga Shekwoyi. <verse eid="ROM 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 7:5" />Ntuge she yi ɓə ye fyi ń nayi, aɓənukwoizhni əpwawo, n owa ɓə kwu ɓa kala zhi gaaga nyi, ɓə ye zhni tnutnu n yi, ń kwo nu ɓə zhni yii ga gyigyi əfyi nya. <verse eid="ROM 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 7:6" />Ama nsaiye, she yi ɓə kwu fyí fyi n ənya n kwo ɓə n yii pashi nyi, a la yi loya n owa, nabai ya myi ya zhni tnutnu n Zafnu zokwo woiwoyi, toge dna n zokwo kwokwoi nyakakai kpəkwnu nya m.<verse eid="ROM 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Owa ǹ leifyii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 7:7" />To, yi ɓa da ɓəye ɓo nge nanu a? Owa zhni leifyi nu? Nanyinanyi! Dudulonu mi to ɓə ɓa kpe ənya n kwo gyi nge leifyi, to owai ɓə gna kwo nyi m. Ntuge mi to ɓə ɓa kpe shewo ye ɓəhnihni, to owai ɓə gna kwa gna, “Fye taa mwi əzado ənya m,” <verse eid="ROM 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 7:8" />Ama leifyi, she kwo ɓə ɓwa aba ntu ɓəgbetu ɓo, kwa kwnu ashewo dəhodəhoi pya ɓe ncei fyi n mi. Ntuge ntna owa, leifyi ɓə fyífyii. <verse eid="ROM 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 7:9" />Dna ń əsa ho, mi ɓə gnyi n wyewyeyii ntna owa, ama she ɓəgbetu ɓə ɓe, leifyi kwa tognyi n wyewyeyii, jesnu maa fyí. <verse eid="ROM 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 7:10" />Mi ɓə kwu gye nge, ɓəgbetu ń kwo nu ɓə gwo kwa ga wyewyeyi nyi, ɓəhnihni, əkwo nu ɓə ɓe ń əfyii. <verse eid="ROM 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 7:11" />Ntuge leifyi, she kwo ɓə zhni apma n ɓəgbetui kwa dna mi kwoce, jesnu dna n ɓəgbetu nu, ń kwo ɓə wu mi. <verse eid="ROM 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 7:12" />Ntulonu nsaiye, owa n gyigyii lo, jesnu ɓəgbetu n gyigyii lo, n cefyé jesnu n bmya.<verse eid="ROM 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 7:13" />To, a ɓa gna nge ənya n kwo bmyabmyai əkwo nu la ɓe mi n əfyii? Nlonu to m, nanyinanyi! Ama nabai ń a ɓa kpe leifyi əye n zhni leifyi, kwa ɓe mi n əfyii, dna ń ənya ń kwo ɓə bmyabmyai. Nabai nge dna ń ɓəgbetu; ń leifyi ɓaa zè leifyi cikpacikpai.<verse eid="ROM 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 7:14" />Yi kpəlo nge owa dnalo n zafnu; ama mi zhni tnazafnuda nu, n kwnukwnui, dna n leifyi akwnu, n zhni fyenu. <verse eid="ROM 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 7:15" />Mi ta ɓwa awyega lo əɓo nya n mi zhni nyi m. Ntuge əɓo n mi ye ma zhni, əkwo nu to n mi zhni m, ama ədo ń mi ta ye m, əkwo nu ń mi zhni. <verse eid="ROM 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 7:16" />Jesnu ndəi mi zhni əɓo nu ń mi to ncei pma ma zhni m, mi la ye nu nge owa bmyalo. <verse eid="ROM 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 7:17" />Ngye shikwonyi, əmi nu to ye zhni kwo, n əmihnii m, ama leifyi ń kwo dna ń əmi nyi. <verse eid="ROM 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 7:18" />Mi kpəlo nge ənya manai ho to dnalo ń mi m, ń kwo nu gyi nge, dna ń əmi nayi leifyizhni nya m. Ntuge a wo mi pwalo nge mi zhni əɓo manai, ama mi taa myi ma zhni kwo m. <verse eid="ROM 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 7:19" />Ntuge mi ta myilo mii zhni əɓo manai ń mi ncei pma ma zhni nyi m; awo, ama əɓo nukwoi ń mi to ncei pma ma zhni nyi m, əkwo nu ń mi gyiabye lo n zhnii. <verse eid="ROM 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 7:20" />Nsaiye, n ma zhni əɓo ń mi to ncei pma ma zhni m, əmi nu to ye gnyi mii zhni kwo m, ama leifyi nu, n kwo dna n mi nyi, nu zhni kwo.<verse eid="ROM 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 7:21" />Ntulonu mi kwu gye owa ye kwoi zhni tnutnu: əsa ń mi ncei pma ma zhni əɓo manai, əɓo nukwoi gnyilo ń abaayi ń kwnusnu n mii. <verse eid="ROM 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 7:22" />Ntuge dna ń əmi ədu, mi n Shekwoyi owa əɓoi pmalo; <verse eid="ROM 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 7:23" />ama mi gye owa do lo kwoi zhni tnutnu dna ń əmi nayi aga, kwoi snukwnú n owai əmi bwugba nya. Nlonu kwoi pa mi dna ń zhalu ń owa leifyi nyai, ń kwo zhni tnutnu fyi ń əmi aga nyi. <verse eid="ROM 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 7:24" />Mi la zè əza aɓwawnayi! Nyika nu ɓa gnyi mi ń nayi leifyizhni nya ye, n kwo gnyi kwoi lo mii ń əfyi nyi a? <verse eid="ROM 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 7:25" />Mi sa Shekwoyi ami lo, dna n Yeisu Kirisiti əyi Dagayi!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 7:25">Ntulonu nsaiye, əmiihnihni dna ń əmi bwugba, mi zhni fyenu nu Shekwoyi owa nya, ama dna ń nayi leifyizhni nya, mi zhni fyenu nu dna ń owa leifyi nya.<verse eid="ROM 7:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ROM 8" />
  <para style="s1">Anyìgyi dna n Zafnu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 8:1" />Ntucenu, knyiznu to lo ntu aza yi ɓo n ɓa fyi ń Kirisiti Yeisu m, <verse eid="ROM 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 8:2" />ntuge dna ń Kirisiti Yeisu, owa Zafnu nya ń wo ga wyewyeyi nyi, wo la ho loya n owa leifyi nya ń əfyii. <verse eid="ROM 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 8:3" />Ntuge əɓo ń owa to ɓə n ikwoi kwa zhni m, ntuge nayi ɓə n kwoi gbakalá, Shekwoyi ɓə kwu kwo zhni dna ń əwo Nugwnu, shi wo ɓə tnu n woi dna ń dogbe nayi leifyi nya, waa zè leifyi nyaga. Ntulonu waa leifyi znuknyi dna ń nayi, <verse eid="ROM 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 8:4" />nabai ń a ɓa nu owa aɓocekpe ɓəfyece nya vnyanya fyi ń yi, əyi ń yi ta gyianyì vyi nayi m, ama vyi Zafnu nya.<verse eid="ROM 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 8:5" />Aza yi n ɓa gyianyì vyi nayi ɓəye, ɓa n əɓa abwugbai zhi ń anya ɓo nu ń nayi n əɓa apwawoi; ama aza yi ń ɓa gyianyì vyi Zafnu, ɓa ń əɓa abwugbai zhi ń anya ɓo nu ń Zafnu n əɓa apwawoi. <verse eid="ROM 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 8:6" />Bwugba ń nayi nu gyibe tu ń kwo, kwo zhni fyifyiyi nu, ama bwugba ń Zafnu nu gyibe tu ń kwo, kwo zhni wyewyeyi nu n bwugbafui. <verse eid="ROM 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 8:7" />Bwugba ń nayi nu gyibe tu ń kwo, kwo pyenapyepyei n Shekwoyii; kwo ta ga əkwohni kwa shi Shekwoyi owa ɓwa m, kwo nyi taa myi n əkwo ɓwashi m. <verse eid="ROM 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 8:8" />Aza yi ń ɓa gyianyì fyi ń nayi, ɓa ta zhni əɓo ń kwo da Shekwoyi m.<verse eid="ROM 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 8:9" />Ama əfyeeda, fye to fyi ń nayi anyìgyi nu m, ama fye fyi ń Zafnu anyìgyi nu, ngye ɓəhnihni nu ge Shekwoyi Zafnu nu dna n fye. Njesnu ngye əzaho lo, ń wo to n Zafnu Kirisiti nyai lo m, wo to zhni Kirisiti nya nu m. <verse eid="ROM 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 8:10" />Ama ń Kirisiti dnalo ń ho, kwo shikwonyi əho nayi ɓə fyí ntu n leifyi ɓo, Zafnu ɓa ga wyewyeyi ntu ɓəfyecezhni ɓo. <verse eid="ROM 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 8:11" />Njesnu, ngye Shekwoyi, ń əwo Zafnui ɓə lá Yeisu kala ń əfyi nyi, wo dnalo n ho, əwo ń wo ɓə la Kirisiti kala ń əfyi nyi, wo ɓa ga əho nayi, ń kwo ɓə fyí nyi, kalá ce, ntu əwo Zafnu ɓo ń wo dna əho nyi.<verse eid="ROM 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 8:12" />Ntucenu, əmi azaje azanugbai n anyikwozai, yi n əɓoi lo n kwo zhni ɓəshishi nu ya zhni; ama kwo to nyi ntu nayi ɓo nu m, əza wa gyianyì vyi əkwo ɓəmwi m. <verse eid="ROM 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 8:13" />Ntuge n fya gyianyì vyi nayi ɓəye, fye ɓa fyí, ama ndəi dna n Zafnu, fyaa kwu aɓoajegbmi nayi nya wu, fye ɓa ɓwa wyewyeyi.<verse eid="ROM 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 8:14" />Ntuge aza yi ń Zafnu Shekwoyi nya nu wu ɓa zokwo, əɓa nu zhni Shekwoyi aɓyi. <verse eid="ROM 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 8:15" />Zafnu ń fye ɓə gwo nyi, wo taa kwu fye zè afyenu, nabai nge fya gyianyì fyi n ədnawo m; n əkwoɓwi, Zafnu n fye ɓə gwo nyi, wo ɓə ɓe n fyei a gwo fye nu, n zhni anugwnu. Jesnu n əwoi nu n yi yi, “Abba, Dada.” <verse eid="ROM 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 8:16" />Zafnu n əwohni tukwoi, wo gbmiɓo lo n əyi zafnui nge yi zhni Shekwoyi aɓyi nu. <verse eid="ROM 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 8:17" />Nsaiye ngye yi zhni aɓyi nu, a gye yi zhni abeɓyi nu. Shekwoyi abeɓyi, jesnu abeɓyi n kwnusnu n Kirisitii, ndəi ɓəhnihni yi ɓa kwnu azhnìgye nabai ń yi ɓə kwnu agbmada wo, əwo latu nya.<verse eid="ROM 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Azhnìgye nsayi nya n latui abye nyai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 8:18" />Mi zhninubwo lo nge azhnìgye nsayi nya to kwnuce lo a mwudo n latui n a ɓə kpeyawu ga yi nyi m. <verse eid="ROM 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 8:19" />Ntuge nyazhnizhni gnyilo kwoi pmi n awyetui nyipyei ń Shekwoyi ɓə kwnu əwo aɓyi wu. <verse eid="ROM 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 8:20" />Ntuge a ɓə la nyazhnizhni zeawyegbmaje, toge n əkwo ɓəyei m, ama n əza ɓəyei n wo ɓə dna kwo nyi, dna n awyetu, <verse eid="ROM 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 8:21" />nge nyazhnizhni n əkwohni tukwoi, a ɓə la kwo loya n əkwo yefnya n əkwo bwobwoi jesnu ai lo ɓe n kwoi dna n loloya ɓədo n latui Shekwoyi aɓyi nya.<verse eid="ROM 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 8:22" />Yi kpəlo nge nyazhnizhni vnyanya gnyilo kwoi domì, ngye ɓyimanyasna nya nsaiye. <verse eid="ROM 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 8:23" />Kwo to ɓwa zo lo nlonu m, ama əyi ń əyihni tukwo, n əyi nu zhni anyagyigyi kpmisnui Zafnu nya nyi, yi domì lo fyi n əyi əmi, əsa n yi zhi yii pmi n wyenyii, nabai yii kwu zhni anugwnuzezè agwogwoyi; əyi anayi shnashna ɓo. <verse eid="ROM 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 8:24" />Ntuge fyi n awyetu ye nu, n a ɓə gnyi yi. Ama awyetu n a gye ɓa əwye, ɓa to zhni awyetu nu m, kpeekpe. Nyika nu zhni wa tu ənya əwye n wo n kwoi pmashilo n akwnu a? <verse eid="ROM 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 8:25" />Ama n ya tuwye n ənya n yi too ɓwa kpa m, ya pmi kwo n bwugbaɓwai.<verse eid="ROM 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 8:26" />N ɓwasnu n zokwo ye, Zafnu bma yi zhni fyi n əyi akalágba. Yi ta kpe əɓo əye n yi ɓa zhniaduwa ntu əkwo ɓo m, ama Zafnu n əwohni tukwoi, wo gbimì ga yi n əmìdoi n ɓədagbma taa shni kwo da m. <verse eid="ROM 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 8:27" />Njesnu əza n wo pmi əyi adu nyi, wo kpe Zafnu bwugba əye lo, ntuge Zafnu gbimì ga Shekwoyi aza, n vyi Shekwoyi ɓəye nu.<verse eid="ROM 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 8:28" />Njesnu yi kpəlo nge fyi n aɓo vnyanya Shekwoyi zhni aɓo amanai ga aza yi nu n ɓa ye wo, aza n a la ɓa yi, vyi əwo ɓəmwi. <verse eid="ROM 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 8:29" />Ntuge aza yi n Shekwoyi ɓə kwu ɓa pmayekpé nyi, wo ɓə la ɓa pmaknyi zhi, ɓai kwu gbədo n əwo Nugwnui, nabai n əwo nu ɓə la zè əɓyi kpmisnui dna n əwo azaje atasni azanugbai n anyikwozai. <verse eid="ROM 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 8:30" />Nlonu, aza yi n wo ɓə la ɓa pmaknyi zhi nyi, wo ɓə la ɓa yi cè; aza yi n wo ɓə yi nyi, wo ɓə la əɓa aɓogyikpmaya ce; aza yi n wo ɓə la əɓa aɓəgyikpmaya nyi, wo ɓə la ɓa latu ce.<verse eid="ROM 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yi du anasalagyiyi lo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 8:31" />To, knyiɓei nu n yi ɓa dnagbe ntu aɓo ye ɓo a? N Shekwoyi gnyigwu yi lo, nyika nu ɓa gnyiapaapa n yi a? <verse eid="ROM 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 8:32" />Əza ń wo to ɓə kna əwo Nugwnu ya gnyi m, ama waa wo taya ga ntu əyi ɓo vnyanya; kwo ɓa zè n wuna, ń wo to ɓə kwnu yi anyaga vnyanya, ɓədo n woi dna ń snusnugye ma a? <verse eid="ROM 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 8:33" />Nyika nu ɓa ma aza yi əɓəho ń Shekwoyi wo la ɓa knyi nyi a? Shekwoyi nu kpmaɓəya. <verse eid="ROM 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 8:34" />Nyika nu gnyilo n wo znu əza əknyi a? Əzaho to lo m. Kirisiti Yeisu nu ń wo ɓe fyí nyi; n dudu ɓo, n a ɓə je wo laka gnyi n wyewyeyi nyi; wo gnyilo n Shekwoyi ɓwaizheɓwa, woi gbimì ga yi. <verse eid="ROM 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 8:35" />Nyika nu ɓa gná yi aje n Kirisiti yeyei a? Azhnìgye nu, kwo əɓoɓədna kwo awyesnugbegye ɓo kwo myikwnu nazhii kwo ɓwotoloi kwo ɓwawu kwo əbeyaakwo a? <verse eid="ROM 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 8:36" />Ngye she a ncei kafyilo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 8:36">“Ntu əho əɓo nu, n yi gye əfyi nya wyizo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 8:36">a n yii zhi ngye aknyi nu, ai ce ɓa asha ya.”<verse eid="ROM 8:36" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ROM 8:37" />Aawo, kpe n aɓo ye vnyanya, yi du anasalagyiyi lo, ntu əwo ɓo n wo ɓə ye yi nyi. <verse eid="ROM 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ROM 8:38" />Ntuge kwo la mi kwnuawye; kwo əfyi kwo wyewyeyi, kwo amaləka kwo ase, kwo anya n ɓa lo nsaiye, kwo anya n ɓa ye ɓeɓelo n abye, kwo kalá dəhodəhoi, <verse eid="ROM 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ROM 8:39" />kwo àsna kwo agyiloloi, kwo nyaho n shnasnu n anyazhnizhni vnyanya, n ɓa ɓá myi ɓa gna yi aje n yeye Shekwoyi nyai, n kwo dnalo ń Kirisiti Yeisu əyi Dagayi nyi m.<verse eid="ROM 8:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ROM 9" />
  <para style="s1">Bwulus bwugbawnu ntu Israila ɓo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 9:1" />Mi da gaiciyanunui nu dna ń Kirisiti; mi ta ceakata nu m. Əmi tukwovnyi kwoi gbmi mi əɓo dna n Zafnu Gyigyiyi <verse eid="ROM 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 9:2" />nge mi n bwugbawnu yaakwoi lo, jesnu bwugbazhii tnazoi fyilo ń əmi ədu. <verse eid="ROM 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 9:3" />Ntuge a wo mi lo ngye a ɓə ɓaa əmi nu tuknyi, jesnu aa mi znuya ń Kirisiti ntu əmi aza ɓo, aza yi ń ɓa nu zhni əmi əbye nyi, <verse eid="ROM 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 9:4" />Aisrailayi. Əɓa nu zhni anugwnuzezè agwogwoyi; əɓa nu n latu zafnu nyai, aɓəgbeshi, n owa gwogwoi, mwamwaga fyi n Dagayipwuwa ɓədo n aɓəgbeshii. <verse eid="ROM 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 9:5" />Adada-azakwoi zhni əɓa nya nu, jesnu ń əɓa nu ń a tnu Masifu əbye nayi nya. Əwo nu zhni Shekwoyi tu ń aza vnyanya, a ɓa ci wo nyalonyalo! Amyi.<verse eid="ROM 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Shekwoyi Ikwoda Duduyi nyáknyiknyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 9:6" />Kwo to lo ngye Shekwoyi ɓədagbma kwo la gbakalá nu m. Ntuge aza vnyanya nu to ń ɓa n əbyeisa ń Israila, ń ɓa zhni Aisrailayi nu m. <verse eid="ROM 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 9:7" />Toge shi ɓa zhni əwo ayawyi nu nyi, ce nu ɓa zhni, əɓa vnyanya, ɓa kwu zè Ibrahim aɓyi m. Kwo snusnu nu ge, “Dna ń Ishakwu ofye nu, ń a ɓə kpé əho ayawyi əye.” <verse eid="ROM 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 9:8" />Fyi n aɓədagbma ədo, nge aɓyi nu to, ń a ɓə kwu ɓa anubwo a ma ɓa ń nayifye nu, ń ɓa zhni Shekwoyi aɓyi m, ama aɓyi aɓəgbeshi nya nu, ń a yi ɓa ge Ibrahim aɓyi. <verse eid="ROM 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 9:9" />Ntuge a ɓə shi əɓəgbe ye nlai nu: “N əsa n a ncei knyishi, mi ɓə jezeɓe jesnu Saratu ɓə ɓwa Əɓyinugba.”<verse eid="ROM 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 9:10" />Kwo to ɓə ɓwa zotu n ɓai nu m, ama kwo ɓə la si Libyeka aɓyi, ń a ɓə lá əɓa nubwo n əsagbmanyii, n əyi dada Ishakwui nyi. <verse eid="ROM 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 9:11" />Dudulonu, a ɓəə snu n a ma àpwo, kwo ge ɓa snu ń ɓa zhni əɓo manai kwo nukwoi; nabai ń a ɓa wu Shekwoyi ɓəmwi ntu zaknyiknyi ɓo kwaa myignyi: <verse eid="ROM 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 9:12" />toge n atnutnui nu m, ama ntu n əza nu, n wo ɓə yi ɓa nyi, a gna wo ge, “Zadnagbmai ɓə la dna n zanawyii snuta.” <verse eid="ROM 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 9:13" />N ɓwasnu shi a ncei kafyilo: “Mi ye Yakwuɓwu lo, ama mi wnunu lo n Isuwai.”<verse eid="ROM 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 9:14" />To yi ɓa gna dəye nge nanu a? Shekwoyi zhni tnagaiciyazhniyi nu u? Kwo fyewyi! <verse eid="ROM 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 9:15" />Ntuge wo ɓe gna Mwusa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:15">“Mi ɓa gye əza snusnu nu, n mi ye ma gye wo snusnu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:15">jesnu mi ɓa wna əza snusnu, n mi ye ma wna wo snusnu.”<verse eid="ROM 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 9:16" />Ntucenu, kwo to kpema n zanyikwoci ɓəmwi nu kwo ɓəzhni m, ama tu ń Shekwoyi snusnugye. <verse eid="ROM 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 9:17" />Ntuge Nyakagyigyiyi ɓə gna Fyirauna: “Mi ɓə lá ho wu n ɓwasnu ń tu n ɓəye tukwo nu, nabai n mi ɓa wu əmi kala tu n əho, n a ɓa da əmi əye ɓo dna ń anyì vnyanya.” <verse eid="ROM 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 9:18" />Ntucenu Shekwoyi gye əza nu snusnu, n wo ncei pma wa gye wo snusnu, jesnu wa kpe əza bwugbakala, n wo ncei pma wa kpe wo bwugbakala.<verse eid="ROM 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 9:19" />Zaknayi dna n əfye, ɓa gna mi: “To knyiyi nu zhni Shekwoyi woi ye ma yi aɓo a? Nyika nu ɓa myi wa gnyiapaapa n əwo ɓəmwi a?” <verse eid="ROM 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 9:20" />Ama ho zhni nyika nu, əho zanyikwoci, ha daɓo n Shekwoyi a? “Ənyazhnizhni ɓa gna əza ń wa zhni kwo nyi, ‘Knyiyi nu na zhni, ho nyi zhni mi n wu nlai a?’ ” <verse eid="ROM 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 9:21" />Kwo ta yezhni shakwnumiyi, wa zhni apma n əznù gbmanyigbmanyii; wa mi shakwnu ntu apma knyiknyii ɓo jesnu adəho, ntu apma asukwui pya ɓo m?<verse eid="ROM 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 9:22" />N kwa zè ge Shekwoyi wo la knyi wa wu əwo minagyi napyei jesnu wa wu əwo kalá, wa ɓwamì yaakwo n anyazhnizhnii əwo minagyi nya; a ɓə zhni ɓa ntu əɓa agbmazhni ɓo nu. <verse eid="ROM 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 9:23" />N kwa zè ge wo ɓə zhni dəye nabai wa wu əwo latu yaakwo nu, ń anya ń wo ɓa wu ɓa snusnugye nyi, aza ń wo ɓə ye ɓa zhi n sapa ntu latu ɓo, <verse eid="ROM 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 9:24" />kwo əyihni, aza n wo ɓə yi ce nyi, toge fyi n Ayahudiyii nu ɓwasnu m, ama ɓədo n Abyedoyii ce. <verse eid="ROM 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 9:25" />Ngye shi wo ɓə da dna n Hosiya pafyi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:25">“Mi ɓə yi ɓá nge, ‘əmi aza’ ń ɓa to ɓə zhni əmi aza nu nyi m;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:25">jesnu mi ɓə yi wo ge ‘əmi əza yeyeyi’ n wo to zhni əmi əza yeyeyi nu m,”<verse eid="ROM 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 9:26" />jesnu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:26">“Dna ń aba ń a ɓə gna ɓa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:26">‘Fye to zhni əmi aza nu m,’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:26">n abaayi nu, n a ɓə yi ɓa ‘Shekwoyi wyewyeyida aɓyi.’ ”<verse eid="ROM 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 9:27" />Ishaya ɓə ceawyi ntu Israila ɓo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:27">“Kwo Aisrailayi, ɓa kwu mwa bəgyé ngye amwi n ɓa ma n shikwo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:27">aza nu n ɓa ɓə cezhi n ɓa ɓə pwo.<verse eid="ROM 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 9:28" />Ntuge Dagayi ɓə dna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:28">anyì n tata, n əwo ɓədagbmai n pyepyei jesnu ntna bwugbadoshna.<verse eid="ROM 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 9:29" />Kwo ɓwasnu lo ngye shi Ishaya ɓə kwu shnida nu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:29">“Akpəge Dagayi Ikwoda Duduyi Vnyanya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:29">Wa kwu ayawyii ho fa zhi yi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:29">yi ɓə ɓa kwu zè ngye Sodom,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:29">yi ye ɓəə kwu wulo ngye Gwomwora.”<verse eid="ROM 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Israila tnagaiciyaga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 9:30" />To yi ɓa gna dəye nge nanu a? Nge Abyedo n ɓa to ɓə zna ɓəfyecezhni shni m, ɓa la kwo ɓwa, ɓəfyecezhni ń a ɓwa kwo dńa n gaiciyaganunui; <verse eid="ROM 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 9:31" />ama Aisrailayi ń ɓa ɓə vyi owa ngye zokwo ɓəfyecezhni nya, ɓa too ɓwa kwo tukwo shi m. <verse eid="ROM 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 9:32" />Knyiɓei nu ɓə kpma ɓa əkwo ɓwa a? Ntuge ɓa to ɓə vyi kwo apita dna ń gaiciyaganunui nu m, ama ngye ɓa ɓə ɓwa kwo n atnutnuzhni nu. Ɓa ɓə la gbidokwnunu kpe ń kwuta bwonyice nya. <verse eid="ROM 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 9:33" />Ngye shi kwo kafyilo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:33">“Gyewye, mi shi kwuta dna n Siyona ń kwo zhni aza lo ɓai knyiabwonyi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:33">jesnu apmá ń kwo zhni ɓai myiya, jesnu əza ń wa ga gaiciya ń wo, a to ɓə dna wo vnyinkwo m, nanyinanyi.”<verse eid="ROM 9:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ROM 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 10:1" />Əmi aza ayeyeyi, azanugbai n anyikwozai, əmi ədu ɓəmwi n aduwazhnii ga Shekwoyi ntu Aisrailayi ɓo, əkwo nu nge, ń ɓa ɓə ɓa kwu pwo. <verse eid="ROM 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 10:2" />Ntuge mi ɓa myi ma gbmi ɓa əɓo nge ɓa n əwyei nyinyíi lo, ntu Shekwoyi əɓo, ama wyenyi ye, too lo ntu n ɓəyekpe ɓo nu m. <verse eid="ROM 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 10:3" />Shikwonyi ɓa to ɓə kpe Shekwoyi ɓəfyecezhni əye m, ntucenu ɓa zhnatna ɓa shi əɓahni nya, ɓa to ɓə n əɓahnii ga fyi n Shekwoyi ɓəfyecezhni m. <verse eid="ROM 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 10:4" />Kirisiti nu zhni owa acezhiba, nabai ń a ɓa ɓwa ɓəfyecezhni ga zahozahoyi ń wo ga gaiciya.<verse eid="ROM 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 10:5" />Mwusa ka əɓo ye ntu ɓəfyecezhni ɓo nu ń kwo vyi owa nyi: “Əza n wo zhni aɓo ye, wo ɓa gyianyì n ɓai nu.” <verse eid="ROM 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 10:6" />Ama ɓəfyecezhni n kwo gbmiɓe ń gaiciyaga, kwo gna: “To da dna n əho ədu, ‘Nyika nu ɓa gwnulo əshemi a?’ ” (N kwo nu gyi nge woo shnizhi ɓe n Kirisitii) <verse eid="ROM 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 10:7" />“Kwo ‘nyika nu ɓa kadna shnilo abaloloi tnaceshiba a?’ ” (N kwo nu gyi nge, woo gbmiɓe n Kirisitii ń əfyi). <verse eid="ROM 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 10:8" />Ama kwa gna ge nanu a? Nge, “Ɓədagbma wo lo vyivyiwyi n hoi; kwo dnalo n əho əgbe ɓədo n əho ədui,” əkwo nu zhni waazi n yi zhni ntu gaiciyaganunui ɓo: <verse eid="ROM 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 10:9" />Ń ha da n əho əgbei, “Yeisu zhni Dagayi nu,” jesnu haa gaiciyaga dna n əho ədu nge Shekwoyi ɓə la wo laka n əfyi, ho ɓa pwo. <verse eid="ROM 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 10:10" />Ntuge n əho ədui nu n ho ga gaiciya, a kpma ho aɓoya, jesnu n əho əgbei nu n ho da əho gaiciyaganunui ɓo, ha pwo. <verse eid="ROM 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 10:11" />Shi Nyakagyigyiyi ncei da lo, “Zahozahoyi n wo ga gaiciya n wo, vnyinkwo taa wo wo m, kpeekpe.” <verse eid="ROM 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 10:12" />Ntuge Yahudiyi to kakai lo n Abyedoyii m, Dagayi gbmanyi nu zhni Dagayi tu n əɓa tukwo vnyanya, woi kpe aza vnyanya anabəlika n ɓa zna wo shni, <verse eid="ROM 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 10:13" />ntuge zahozahoyi n wo yi Dagayi əye, wo ɓə la pwo.<verse eid="ROM 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 10:14" />To nsaiye, aza ɓa yi əza n wunanu n ɓa too ga gaiciya dna n wo ma a? Njesnu ɓa ɓá ga gaiciya n əza n wunanu n ɓa to wo əwo əɓo ma a? Njesnu ɓa ɓá wo n wunanu ntna əza n wo ɓa zhni waazi ga ɓa a? <verse eid="ROM 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 10:15" />Njesnu ɓa ɓá zhni waazi n wunanu to ai tnu ɓa nu ma a? Ngye she kwo kafyilo nyi: “Ho gyelo shi aza yi apita n bmyabmyai n ɓa ɓe n nabagyi manai nyi!”<verse eid="ROM 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 10:16" />Ama Aisrailayi vnyanya nu to ɓə gwo nabagyi manai m. Ntuge Ishaya ɓə kwu da, “Dagayi, nyikanu ń la gaiciya ga n əyi ɓədatnu a?” <verse eid="ROM 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 10:17" />Ntulonu, gaiciyaganunui ɓe n waazi wowoi nu, jesnu a wo waazi dna n ɓədagbma nu ntu Kirisiti ɓo. <verse eid="ROM 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 10:18" />Ama mi nyaɓo lo: Ɓa to ɓə wo nu m? N kwnusnu, ɓa ɓə kwu wo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:18">“Əɓa ɓədatnu ɓə la lapwi fyi n əknyi vnyanya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:18">əɓa ɓədagbma kwa kwu si anyìcezhiba.”<verse eid="ROM 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 10:19" />Ama, mi nyaɓo lo: Israila to ɓə ɓwa awyega nu m? Kpmisnui, Mwusa ɓə gna,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:19">“Mi ɓa zhni fye fya woshe n aza yii n ɓa to zhni əbye nu m;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:19">Mi ɓa zhni minagyi kwa gyi fye, n əbyei n kwo to n awyegai lo m.”<verse eid="ROM 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 10:20" />Nlonu Ishaya daɓo lo n əgbei myimyii,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:20">“Aza yi n ɓa to ɓə zna mi shni nyi m, ɓà ɓə la mi ɓwa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:20">Mi ɓə la əmihni kpeyawu aza yi n ɓa to ɓə nya mi əɓo nyi m.”<verse eid="ROM 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 10:21" />Ama ntu Israila ɓo, wo gna lo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:21">“Dna n wyizo vnyanya, mi la əmi aɓwa kpeyawu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:21">aza atnaɓəgbetuvyiyi n atukwognanakwoyii.”<verse eid="ROM 10:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ROM 11" />
  <para style="s1">Shekwoyi to na əwo aza aɓo m</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 11:1" />To, mi nyaɓo lo: Shekwoyi ɓə la əwo aza aɓo na nu u? Kwo fyewyi! Mi zhni Israilayi nu n əmihni tukwo, Ibrahim yawyi, mi gbmi n Banyami əbye. <verse eid="ROM 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 11:2" />Shekwoyi to ɓə na əwo aza aɓo m, aza n wo ɓə n ɓai pmayekpé nyi m. Fye ta kpe əɓo əye lo ń Nyakagyigyiyi ncei da lo fyi nyaka ntu Iliya ɓo m, she wo ɓə tna Shekwoyi aɓwa, woi kpe Aisrailayi aɓo: <verse eid="ROM 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 11:3" />“Dagayi, ɓa kwu əho sheaɓəgwognayi wu, jesnu ɓa la əho bəgədi ɓaya; əmi nu ɓwa cegnyi, jesnu ɓa to gnyi ɓai ye ɓa wu mi nu m”? <verse eid="ROM 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 11:4" />Knyiɓei nu ɓə zhni Shekwoyi ɓəgbedna ga wo a? “Mi n aza adugwu-tnaabai wnakna zhilo ga əmihni, n ɓa too knyiakwokwo zhi Baali m.” <verse eid="ROM 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 11:5" />Ntulonu ce, nsaiye aza cezhilo, n a ɓə tnu ɓa zhi, dna əmi shebmyashi. <verse eid="ROM 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 11:6" />Ngye n Shekwoyi shebmyashii nu, a gye kwo to ɓə nyi ntu əɓa atnutnu ɓo nu m; kwo ɓə gna kwo gnyi n tnutnu ɓo nu, shebmyashi to ɓə ɓa shna shebmyashi zhni m.<verse eid="ROM 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 11:7" />To knyiyi nu a? Ənya n Aisrailayi ɓə znashni n əwyei bmyibmyii, ɓa to ɓə ɓwa kwo shi m. Aza aknyiknyiyi nu fyi n ɓa, n ɓa ɓə ɓwa kwo. Ama azaje ɓə n abwugbai kpakalá, <verse eid="ROM 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 11:8" />ngye she kwo kafyilo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:8">“Shekwoyi ɓə la zafnu tnagənyikpe nya ga ɓa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:8">awye n ɓa ta gyewyeba m</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:8">ɓədo n atnubwai to ɓai wo atnubwaɓo m,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:8">nya n naiye ń kwo gnyi nyi.”<verse eid="ROM 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 11:9" />Njesnu Dawuda gna lo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:9">“Fa əɓa tebwul nyagyi nya kwaa zè agbúlu kwa pyi ɓa agam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:9">abwonyice aba jesnu aɓotagbaba ga ɓa.<verse eid="ROM 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 11:10" />Fa əɓa awye ɓa kwu fyi wyegbma nabai to ɓa gyewyeba m,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:10">jesnu ɓaa yakpe n əɓa abwokwnu nyalonyalo.”<verse eid="ROM 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mwulapa shnuwna aɓwala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 11:11" />Njesnu mi nyaɓo lo: Ɓa ɓə cebwonyi nabai ɓa myiya n ɓa taa shni kalakwu nu m? Kwo fyewyi! Kwo wulo nge ntu əɓa abwi ɓo nu, n gnyignyi kwo la ɓe da Abyedo nabai kwa dna Israila shewo. <verse eid="ROM 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 11:12" />Ama ngye əɓa abwi kwo la zè nyaɓwa nu ga anyì, jesnu əɓa nuwnaɓwi kwo la zè nyaɓwa nu ntu n Abyedo ɓo; to, a gye nyaɓwa ɓə lá gna yaakwo zhnizhni, she a ɓə la ɓa je gwo fyi n nunui!<verse eid="ROM 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 11:13" />Mi gnyi mii daɓo n əfyei nu Abyedo. Shikwonyi əmi nu zhni tnutnuloyi Abyedo nya, mi gbma lo dna n əmi ɓəvyitnutnu. <verse eid="ROM 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 11:14" />Mi n awyetui lo nge n zokwo, ho mi ɓa zhni əmi aza Ayahudiyi ɓa woshe, jesnu azaho ɓa ɓwa gnyignyi n ɓa. <verse eid="ROM 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 11:15" />Ntuge ngye a ɓə na ɓa aɓo, kwonyi la ɓe anyì n aɓodownai n Shekwoyii; to, əɓa jegwogwo ɓə ɓe n knyiyii nu a, kwo to ɓə gbmi wyewyeyi nu ɓe ncei n əfyi m? <verse eid="ROM 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 11:16" />Ngye biledi pisai tnaknai n a ga nge nyaga kpmisnui, n kwo gyigyii lo, a gye əkwo ɓwugyi kwo gyigyii lo; ngye gbegye gyigyii lo, akpəge əkwo aɓwala gyigyii lo ce.<verse eid="ROM 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 11:17" />Ngye a la aɓwala ho bmaya, jesnu əfye, kwo shikwonyi fye zhni zaitu aɓwala zhabwi nya nu, ń a pa amwula fyi n ashnuwna ajei, ama nsaiye fye kwnusnu lo n nuwnagbmai n kwo kwnu n zaitu gbegye nyi, <verse eid="ROM 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 11:18" />fye to gye əfyehni ngye fye kwu du aɓwala adəyi nya nu m. N fya zhni nlonu, fye pa ge: Əfye nu to n agbegyei shi m, ama agbegye nu n fyei shi. <verse eid="ROM 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 11:19" />To, fye ɓa myi fya gna, “A ɓə bma aɓwala ya nabai ń a ɓa pa əmi nu gyi.” <verse eid="ROM 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 11:20" />Gaiciya nu. Ama a ɓə bma ɓa ya ntu ń əɓa tnagaiciyaga ɓo nu, əfyeeda zhi n gaiciyaganunui nu. Fye to kwu zhni atukwomwayi m, ama fye kwu fyi n vnyivnyi nu. <verse eid="ROM 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 11:21" />Ntuge ngye Shekwoyi to ɓə fa aɓwala ahnihnii m, wo to ɓə fa fye ce m.<verse eid="ROM 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 11:22" />Ntucenu fye pa Shekwoyi abmyazhni ɓo, n bwugbanazhii: bwugbanazhi n aza yii n ɓa ɓə myiya nyi, ama abmyazhni ɓo, ndəi fya gwodu fyi ń əwo abmyazhni. Ntolonu m, əfyehni ce, a ɓə la fye ceya. <verse eid="ROM 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 11:23" />Jesnu ndei n ɓa to kwu shenu fyi ń tnagaiciyaga nu m, a ɓə kwu ɓa pamwula, ntuge Shekwoyi ɓa myi wa je ɓa amwula pa. <verse eid="ROM 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 11:24" />Yi kpəlo ge, ngye a ɓə ce fye n zhabwi zaitu shnuwna nu, n a ta shni kwo zhni lonu nyi m, a kwu fye pamwula n zaitu shnuwna apyi nyai, a taa gna aɓwala shnuwna yi nya amwulapapa nu n əɓahni zaitu shnuwna yi m!<verse eid="ROM 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Israila vnyanya ɓə kwu pwo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 11:25" />Mi to ncei pmalo fya kwu zhi n ɓəyeɓwi asigyi ye nyai m, əmi azaje azanugbai n anyikwozai, nabai n tukwomwa taa kwu nu əfye bwugba m. Israila wo lá bwugbakalákpe towo n səpa ho, nya əsa n Abyedo bəgyé, n nunui, shi a ncei tu, ɓə kwu loɓe, <verse eid="ROM 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 11:26" />jesnu n zokwo ye, Israila vnyanya ɓə kwu pwo. A ncei kafyilo: “Gnyiyi ɓə gbmiɓe n Siyona nu. Wo ɓə la tnashekwoyi ədnawo gbmiya ń Yakwuɓwu.<verse eid="ROM 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 11:27" />“Dəye nu zhni əmi ɓəgbeshi n ɓai</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:27">she mi ɓə la əɓa aleifyi kwuya.”<verse eid="ROM 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 11:28" />Ntu aɓo n ɓa fyi n nabagyi manai nyi, ɓa zhni anuwnuyi nu ntu əfye ɓo; ama ntu azaknyi ɓo, ɓa zhni ayeyei nu ntu adada-azakwoi ɓo, <verse eid="ROM 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 11:29" />ntuge Shekwoyi nyaga n əwo yiyii a taa kpe ɓa doshna m. <verse eid="ROM 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 11:30" />N ɓwasnu shi n əsa ho, fye ɓə zhni atnaɓəgbetunuyi nu, ń Shekwoyi aba, ama nsaiye fye kwu snusnugye ɓwa, ntu əɓa tnaɓəgbetuvyi ɓo. <verse eid="ROM 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 11:31" />Ntulonu nsaiye əɓahni ɓa kwu zè atnaɓəgbetunuyi nabai n əɓahni ce, n ɓa ɓá gwo snusnugye nsaiye ntu Shekwoyi snusnugye ɓo n əfye aba. <verse eid="ROM 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 11:32" />Ntuge Shekwoyi wo la zahozahoyi pa dna n tnaɓəgbetuvyi nabai n wo ɓa gye ɓa snusnu əɓa vnyanya.<verse eid="ROM 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Shekwoyi amisa</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 11:33" />Oo, nyaɓwa loloyi Shekwoyi wyemwa nya n ɓəyekpei!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:33">Əwo owada ń a taa myi n kwo pmi m,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:33">jesnu əwo awogyei n a taa myi ń ɓa vyi m!<verse eid="ROM 11:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 11:34" />“Nyikanu lo n wo kwu Dagayi bwugba kpeye a?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:34">Kwo nyika nu zhni əwo ɓəwuyii a?”<verse eid="ROM 11:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 11:35" />“Nyika nu lá ənya shni Shekwoyi ga a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:35">n Shekwoyi ɓa gba wo əkwo əta a?”<verse eid="ROM 11:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 11:36" />Ntuge n əwo aba nu jesnu ǹ əwoi nu jesnu ntu əwo əɓo nu ń anya vnyanya zhi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:36">Latu nyalonyalo nya zhni əwo nya nu! Amyi.<verse eid="ROM 11:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ROM 12" />
  <para style="s1">Nyagbmi wyewyeyi nya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 12:1" />Ntucenu, əmi azaje n əmi amapwii, mi tna fye əɓwa, ntu n Shekwoyi snusnugye ɓo, fye kwu əfye anayi ga n zhni nyagbmi wyewyeyi nya, n gyigyiyi, n əkwo əɓo da Shekwoyi; dəye nu zhni əfye mwamwaga hnihnii jesnu ceewoi nya. <verse eid="ROM 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 12:2" />Fye to je anyì ye ofye vyi m, ama fye la əfye abwugba shnado ɓa kwu zè awoiwoyi. Nlonu n fye ɓa myi fya tumwi jesnu fya tuɓwa n əɓo n kwo zhni Shekwoyi ɓəye; əwo ɓəye manai, dadai jesnu n kwo nunui.<verse eid="ROM 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tukwogba tnutnu dna n Kirisiti nayi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 12:3" />Ntu ń shebmyashi ɓo ń a ncei ga mi nyi, mi gna zahozahoyi ń fye: To zhni əɓonubwo n du she kwo gwo ha zhni m, ama ń əkwoɓwi, zhni əhohni ɓənubwo n ədnai, vyi gaiciyaganunui ń Shekwoyi la gná ga zahozahoyi n fye nyi. <verse eid="ROM 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 12:4" />N ɓwasnu she zahozahoyi ń yi, ń nayii gbmanyi nu, n agai mwa bəgyé, jesnu aga ye vnyanya, ɓa ta zhni tnutnu gbmanyigbmanyi nu m. <verse eid="ROM 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 12:5" />Ntulonu dna ń Kirisiti, əyi, kwo shikwonyi, yi mwa bəgyé lo, yi zhni nayi gbmanyi nu, jesnu əga dəhodəhoi zhni aga aje vnyanya nya nu. <verse eid="ROM 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 12:6" />Yi n anyagai lo gbowogbowo, vyi shebmyashi, n a ncei ga zahozahoyi n yi nyi. Ngye əho nyaga zhni sheɓəgwognayi dai nu, nlonu da sheɓəgwogna, she əho gaiciyaganunui lo. <verse eid="ROM 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 12:7" />Ngye tnutnuzhni ga aza nu, akpəge ho zhni tnutnu; ngye kwo zhni nyawu nu, akpəge ho wunya; <verse eid="ROM 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 12:8" />ngye kwo zhni aza bwugbakalafyi nu, akpəge ho fyi aza bwugbakala. Ngye kwo zhni n nyagaga nu, akpəge ho ganya n əɓwai loloiya; ngye kwo zhni gnabyezhni nu, akpəge ho zhni kwo n əwyei bmyibmyii; ngye kwo zhni snusnugyewu nu, akpəge ho wu kwo n bwugbadai.<verse eid="ROM 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeyewu dna n əkwo tnutnuzhni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 12:9" />Ɓəshishi nu yeyewu kwaa zè ədu gbmanyi ɓəzhni. Wnunu n nukwoi; la gyima ń əɓo n kwo zhni manai. <verse eid="ROM 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 12:10" />Fye kwu əfyehni ga fyi ń aje akwnu dna ń yeye. Əza wo ga əwo ədo mwamwa n du əwohni. <verse eid="ROM 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 12:11" />Fye to kwu zhi ntna wyenyi m, ama fye kwu əfye yeyewu zafnu shiɓwa kamkam, fyei zhni Dagayi tnutnu. <verse eid="ROM 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 12:12" />Fye dagbma fyi ń awyetu, fye ɓwa bwugba fyi n azhnìgye, fya kwu zhni agbenuyi fyi ń aduwazhni. <verse eid="ROM 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 12:13" />Fye ce anya ga Dagayi aza n ɓa fyilo n snagyi. Fye zhni fyei gwo azhiɓeyi n yeyei.<verse eid="ROM 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 12:14" />Fye kpe aza yi anabəlika ń ɓa she fye wyena nyi; fye kpe ɓa anabəlika nu, fye to kpe ɓa aknyi m. <verse eid="ROM 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 12:15" />Fye dagbma n aza yii n ɓa dagbma; fye zhni bwugbazhii n aza yii ń ɓa fyi n bwugbazhii. <verse eid="ROM 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 12:16" />Fye gyianyì n əɓwai dnado n ajei. Fye to mwa əfyehni tukwo m, ama fye ye azaje nabai fya kwnu asese n aza yii n ɓa gbàgbài. Fye to kwu nu zhi n tukwomwai m.<verse eid="ROM 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 12:17" />Fye to gba nukwoi əta n nukwoi m. Fye zhni pəceye fya zhni əɓo n kwo bmya n zahozahoyi awyeba. <verse eid="ROM 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 12:18" />Ngye kwo ɓa yezhni, shikwonyi kwo vyi shi fye wu nu, fye gyianyì n bwugbafui n zahozahoyii. <verse eid="ROM 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 12:19" />Fye to gbaɓota m, əmi anugwnudo ayeyeyi, fye la aba ga ntu Shekwoyi minagyi napyei ɓo, ntuge kwo kafyilo: “Tagba zhni əmi nya nu; Mi ɓə gbaɓota,” əɓo nu n Dagayi wa da. <verse eid="ROM 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 12:20" />N əkwoɓwi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 12:20">“Ngye əho nuwnuyi gnyilo n myikwnui, ga wo nyagyi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 12:20">ngye nuwna myikwnu wo əwo lo, ga wo nyaho wa sni.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 12:20">N fya zhni nlonu, fye ɓa gnyi fyei ye anakna kpe əfye nuwnuyi nu n tukwo.”<verse eid="ROM 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 12:21" />Fye to fa nukwoi kwa gyi fye əsnu m, ama fye gyi nukwoi əsnu n manaii.<verse eid="ROM 12:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ROM 13" />
  <para style="s1">Fye kwu əfyehni gafyi n aikwoda akwnu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 13:1" />Fa zahozahoyi waa əwohni gadna ń aikwoda akwnu, ntuge ikwo to lo m, akpəge ədo ń Shekwoyi wo la shi nyi. Ikwo ń kwo lo nyi, Shekwoyi nu ɓə shi kwo. <verse eid="ROM 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 13:2" />Ntucenu, zahozahoyi ń wo gnyiapaapa lo n ikwoi, wo gnyiapaapa n ənyai nu n Shekwoyi wo la shi, jesnu aza yi n ɓa zhni ce, ɓa ɓe ɓahni n owadai nu. <verse eid="ROM 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 13:3" />Ntuge abegyiyi to zhni anya ədnanazhii nu ń aza yi aba ń ɓa zhni aɓo manai nyi m, ama ń aza aba n ɓa zhni aɓo nukwoi, ɓa wodna. Ho ncei pmalo ha gnyi ntna ədna ikwoda nya? Akpəge ho zhni əɓo ń kwo bmya jesnu ń a ɓa ci ho. <verse eid="ROM 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 13:4" />Ntuge əza n ikwo dna ń əwo akwnu, wo zhni Shekwoyi tnutnuyi nu, nabai n aɓo ɓa lo n bmya. Ama ń fya zhni əɓo nukwoi, fye wodna, ntuge abegyiyi ta la əbeyaakwo ntna ɓətukwo m. Ɓa zhni Shekwoyi atnutnuyi nu, aminagyi shiyi nabai ɓa ga aɓənukwoizhniyi tata. <verse eid="ROM 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 13:5" />Ntucenu, kwo zhni ɓəshishi nu fya kwu əfyehni ga fyi ń aikwoda akwnu, toge n ɓwasnu ntu ń tata ɓo m, ama jesnu ntu n bwugbafu ɓwa əho tukwovnyi nya ɓo.<verse eid="ROM 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 13:6" />Dəye nu je əɓo zhni ń kwo zhni fyei gba gədu, ntuge aikwoda zhni Shekwoyi atnutnuyi nu, ń ɓa kwu əɓa əsa ga vnyanya ntu əbegyi ɓo. <verse eid="ROM 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 13:7" />Fye ga zahozahoyi ənya n fye ń əkwo ətai shi wo: N fye n gədui nu shi əta, a gba gədu; n gnyikwogyi nu, akpəge a gba gnyikwogyi; ngye mwamwaga nu, akpəge a ga mwamwa; ngye lalatu nu, akpəge latu.<verse eid="ROM 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeyewu nu zhni owa nunu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 13:8" />Fye to kwu zhi n atai shi m, akpəge yeyewu əta, ədo n taa zo kwo gba nyi m, ntuge zahozahoyi ń wo wu azaje yeye wo kwu owa nu. <verse eid="ROM 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 13:9" />Aɓəgbetu nu nyi, “Fye taa zhni anagbái m,” “Fye taa wu əza m,” “Fye taa wyivyi m,” “Fye taa mwi əzado ənya m,” jesnu kwo n aɓəgbetu ajei n ɓa lo, a n ɓai wnafyi vnyanya n ɓəgbetu ye nu: “Ye əho kwnuzhiyi ngye əhohni.” <verse eid="ROM 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 13:10" />Yeyewu ta wu kwnuzhiyi əɓwa m. Ntucenu yeyewu nu zhni owa nunu.<verse eid="ROM 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nyipyei yi kwo la wo vyivyiwyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 13:11" />Njesnu fye zhni ɓəye, shi fye kpəlo əsa pya n kwo gnyi nyi: Snukna kwo lá fye lu si, ń fye ɓa kwnúagyewyi n əgyezhni, ntuge əyi gnyignyi kwo la gnawó vyivyiwyi, a fa əsa n yi ɓə kpmi gaiciyaga nyi. <verse eid="ROM 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 13:12" />Sukwo kwo lá ga zo; fyegyi ɓwace lo fyewyi nu. Ntulonu yi la atnutnu awyegbma nya kpmaya jesnu ya kpe akwnukaya bwuznagna nya. <verse eid="ROM 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 13:13" />Fye fa ya zhniaɓo ń cefyé, ngye yi fyi n nyipyei nu, toge ngye yi fyi ń nyasni n əjezhnii m, toge n anagbáizhni n ajewna asisi nyai m, toge n anyàwu n shewoi m. <verse eid="ROM 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 13:14" />N əkwoɓwi, fye kwu əfyehni pwi n Dagayi Yeisu Kirisitii, jesnu to fya zhni əɓonubwo she fye ɓa kwu əfyehni dafyi n agbmada nayi ɓəmwi nya m.<verse eid="ROM 13:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ROM 14" />
  <para style="s1">Akalágbai n akaládaii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 14:1" />Fye gwo əza n əwo gaiciyaganunui n akalágbai lo, ntna anyàwu kpe n aɓo aɓənakpeaje nya. <verse eid="ROM 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 14:2" />Əzaho gaiciyaganunui ye wo nge wo gyi nyahonyahoi, ama zado n əwo gaiciyaganunui n gbakála lo, wo ɓwa afnyitolo nu gyi. <verse eid="ROM 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 14:3" />Əza n wo gyi nyahonyahoi nyi, wo to ci əza wyegba n wo ta gyilo nyi m. N kasnu əza n wo ta gyi nyahonyahoi lo nyi m, wo to da əza owa n wo gyilo m, ntuge Shekwoyi wo la ɓa kwnu gwo. <verse eid="ROM 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 14:4" />Ho zhni nyikanu, ha da zado tnutnuyi owa a? N əwo Dagayi aba nu, n wo ɓa gnyiagnyi, kwo wa myiya. Njesnu n wo ɓaa myìgnyi ntuge əwo Dagayi ɓa myi wa zhni wo waa myìgnyi.<verse eid="ROM 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 14:5" />Əzaho n nyipyei gbmanyi knyignyi n du nyipyei ədo n gyigyi; zado wa gye anyipyei vnyanya n zhni gbmanyigbmanyi nu. Zahozahoyi wo zhni əɓo n kwo la wo kwnuawye n əwo bwugba. <verse eid="ROM 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 14:6" />Zahozahoyi n wo n nyipyei gbmanyi knyi, n zhni duduyi, wo zhni dəye ga Dagayi nu. Zahozahoyi ń wo gyi abwu, wo gyi ga Dagayi nu, ntuge wo ga Shekwoyi amisa; jesnu zahozahoyi n wo na abwu gyi ɓo, wo zhni dəye ga Dagayi nu, jesnu wo ga Shekwoyi amisa. <verse eid="ROM 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 14:7" />Ntuge əzaho to lo ń wo gyianyì ga əwohni nu gbmanyi m, jesnu əzaho to lo n wo fyí əwohni əfyi nu gbmanyi m. <verse eid="ROM 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 14:8" />N yi gyianyì lo, yi gyianyì ga Dagayi nu; jesnu n ya fyí, yi fyí ga Dagayi nu. Ntulonu, kwo yii gyianyì nu, kwo n ya fyí nu, yi zhni Dagayi anya nu. <verse eid="ROM 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 14:9" />Ntu n ɓəye ɓo nu, n Kirisiti ɓə fyí jesnu wa jezeɓe n wyewyeyii nabai n wo ɓaa zè Dagayi afyífyiyi nya ɓədo n awyewyeyidai.<verse eid="ROM 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 14:10" />Nlonu, əho, knyiyi nu zhni hoi da əhozado kwo mapwi owa a? Kwo knyiyi nu zhni hoi ci əzado wyegba a? Ntuge əyi vnyanya, yi ɓe gnyiagnyi zhi ń Shekwoyi owada shnikpegye abye. <verse eid="ROM 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 14:11" />Kwo kafyilo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 14:11">“Dagayi ncei da lo, ‘Ndei mi ye shnisnusnu lo ń wyewyeyii,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 14:11">nyikwutukwo dəhodəhoi ɓə ceakwokwo shi n əmi abye;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 14:11">nyitala dəhodəhoi ɓə ci Shekwoyi.’ ”<verse eid="ROM 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 14:12" />Ntulonu, zahozahoyi n yi, wo ɓə ga əwo nyadokwu ń Shekwoyi aba.<verse eid="ROM 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 14:13" />Ntucenu, yi kwu fa əyihni aje owada ɓo. N əkwoɓwi, la bwugbadna, to ha zhni zahozahoyi wa cebwonyi m, kwo ha znu ənya dushi, əhozado kwo mapwi wa myiya m. <verse eid="ROM 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 14:14" />Kwo la mi kwnuawye, jesnu kwo la mi la n əmi bwugba vnyanya dna ń Dagayi Yeisu, nge nyaho to lo ń kwo tucegye dna ń əkwohni m. Ama ngye zaho, wo la nyaho cewye nge tnagyigyii, nlonu kwo zhni tnagyii nu ń əza yi aba. <verse eid="ROM 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 14:15" />Ngye bwugba kwo la əhozado kwo mapwii wnu ntu ənya ɓo n ho gyi, ho to ye znazna dna ń yeye nu m. To ye ənya n ho gyi nyi, kwa zhni zaho agbma, n Kirisiti ɓə fyi ntu n wo əɓo nyi m. <verse eid="ROM 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 14:16" />Ntucenu, to fa a da ənya ɓo ń ho kpəlo ge kwo bmyalo kwaa zedna n zhni nukwoi m. <verse eid="ROM 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 14:17" />Ntuge Shekwoyi əbemi, to zhni nyagyi gyi ɓo nu, ń ənyasnisnii m, ama ɓəfyecezhni, bwugbafu n agbmadai dna n Zafnu Gyigyiyi. <verse eid="ROM 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 14:18" />Ntuge zahozahoyi n wo zhni Kirisiti tnutnu ń zokwo ye, əwo ɓo dá Shekwoyi, jesnu wo ɓwa azanyikwoci ɓəye.<verse eid="ROM 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 14:19" />Ntucenu, fye fa ya ye əyihni ya zhni əɓo n kwo ɓe n bwugbafui jesnu kwa kwu əfye ɓwadodna myizhi. <verse eid="ROM 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 14:20" />To kwu Shekwoyi tnutnu zhniagbma ntu nyagyi ɓo m. Anyagyi vnyanya n gyigyii lo, ama kwo to bmyalo əza wa gyi ənya n kwo ɓa zhni zado gbowo, wa cebwonyi m. <verse eid="ROM 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 14:21" />Kwo gnabmya lo to əza wa gyi nyagyi, kwo wa sni anamnuwna kwo wa zhni ɓədo gbowo, n kwo ɓa zhni əwodo kwo mapwi wa myiya m.<verse eid="ROM 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 14:22" />Ntulonu, ɓəhoɓəhoi n ho n gaiciyagai lo n aɓo ye nya, kwu ɓa fyi ń əho bwugba atasni n Shekwoyi. Anabəlikada nu ń əza yii, ń wo to znu əwohni əknyi, ntu anya ɓo, ń wo la tuɓwa nge aɓo gnabmyai nu m. <verse eid="ROM 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 14:23" />Ama zahozahoyi ń wo kwu abwugba-aba fyi, ń wa gyi kwo, wo la əwohni znuknyi, ntuge wo ta gyi kwo dna n gaiciyaga nu m. Njesnu nyahonyahoi n kwo ta gbmi n gaiciyaganunui nu m, kwo zhni leifyi nu.<verse eid="ROM 14:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ROM 15" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 15:1" />Əyi ń yi n gaiciyanunui lo n dnakalá nyi, kwo gwo ya ɓwabwugba n azai ń ɓa to ncei lo n dnakalá m, jesnu to ya zna əyihni ɓəgbmada nu shni m. <verse eid="ROM 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 15:2" />Zahozahoyi ń əyi, wo zhni əɓo ń kwo ɓa da əyi akwnuzhiyi ntu n əkwo apma ɓo; nabai ya mi ɓa, ɓa mwa. <verse eid="ROM 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 15:3" />Kwo Kirisiti n əwohni, wo to ɓə zhni əɓo nu ń kwo da wo m, ama ngye shi kwo kafyilo, “Aza yi akpmiknyi, n ɓa knyi ho nyi, ɓa la kaya kpe ń mi.” <verse eid="ROM 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 15:4" />Ntuge nyahonyahoi ń a ɓə ncei kashi n sapa, kwo ɓə kakpe ntu əyi nyawu əɓo nu. Nabai dna n bwugbaɓwa n əkwo nyawui fyi n Anyakagyigyiyi, jesnu n bwugbakaládnai n kwo ga nyi, n yi ɓa myi ya ɓwa awyetu.<verse eid="ROM 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 15:5" />Fa Shekwoyi n wo ga bwugbaɓwa n bwugbakaládnai nyi, wa ga fye bwugbadna gbmanyigbmanyi ntu n aje ɓo, ədo pya n Kirisiti Yeisu ɓə ncei nyi, <verse eid="ROM 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 15:6" />nabai n bwugbai gbmanyi, jesnu n bəgyei gbmanyi, n fye ɓa myi fya ga Shekwoyi latu n Dadai, əyi Dagayi Yeisu Kirisiti nya.<verse eid="ROM 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 15:7" />Nlonu, fye gwo aje aɓwa-aba-aba, n ɓwasnu shi Kirisiti ɓə gwo fye nyi, nabai kwa ɓe Shekwoyi n cicii. <verse eid="ROM 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 15:8" />Ntuge əmi nu gna fye nge, Kirisiti wo la zè Ayahudiyi tnutnuyi n Shekwoyi gaiciyanunui apita, nabai aɓəgbezhi n a ɓə zhi əyi adada-azakwoi nyi, ń a ɓaa kwu ɓa wnashi, <verse eid="ROM 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 15:9" />jesnu ntuge, nabai n Abyedo ɓa myi ɓa ga Shekwoyi latu ntu əwo snusnugye ɓo. Ngye shi a ncei kafyilo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:9">“Ntucenu mi ɓa ci ho dna ń Abyedo atasni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:9">Mi ɓa kwoanyi əho əye cici nya.”<verse eid="ROM 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 15:10" />Njesnu, kwo gna lo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:10">“Əfye Abyedo fye nya agbmada ɓədo n</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:10">əwo azai.”<verse eid="ROM 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 15:11" />Njesnu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:11">“Fye ci Dagayi, əfye Abyedo vnyanya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:11">fa aza vnyanya ɓa kwoanyi cici nya ga wo.”<verse eid="ROM 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 15:12" />Njesnu, Ishaya gna lo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:12">“Jesse gbegye ɓə gbmiwye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:12">əza n wo ɓə laka gnyi woi gyibe tu n abye;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:12">dna n əwo nu n Abyedo ɓə tuwye.”<verse eid="ROM 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 15:13" />Fa Shekwoyi awyetu ɓa nu fye n agbmadai vnyanya ɓədo n bwugbafui shi fye kpema n wo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:13">nabai ń fye ɓa nu fyei gyiya n awyetui</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:13">dna n kalá Zafnu Gyigyiyi nya.<verse eid="ROM 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bwulus Abyedo tnutnuyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 15:14" />Əmi n əmihni, kwo la mi kwnuawye, əmi azaje n amapwuyii, nge əfye, n əfyehni tukwo, fye nunui lo n əɓo manai, n nunui n ɓəyekpei jesnu n kwnuce fya ga aje gbega. <verse eid="ROM 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 15:15" />Dudulonu mi kwu ənya ka ga fye n əgbei myimyii dəidəi kpe n aɓəho ntuge ma je fye əɓa ɓəpá njesnu, ntu shebmyashi ɓo n Shekwoyi ɓə ga mi nyi <verse eid="ROM 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 15:16" />maa zè Kirisiti Yeisu tnutnuyi ga Abyedo. Wa ga mi pirisiti tnutnu, ma zhni Shekwoyi nabagyi manai waazi, nabai n Abyedo ɓa myi ɓa kwu zè nyaga gwogwoyi ń Shekwoyi aba, ń pmyapmyai n Zafnu Gyigyiyii.<verse eid="ROM 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 15:17" />Ntucenu mi gbma lo dna ń Kirisiti Yeisu dna ń əmi tnutnuzhni ga Shekwoyi. <verse eid="ROM 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 15:18" />Mi taa ye ma daɓo tu n ɓəhoɓəhoi m, akpəge tu n əɓo ń Kirisiti wo kwu zozhni dna ń mi, kwoi zhni Abyedo ɓai vyi Shekwoyi ɓəgbetu ntu əɓo ɓo n mi kwu da jesnu mi kwu zhni; <verse eid="ROM 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 15:19" />dna n kalá aznù wu nya n aɓoawowoi, dna n kalá Shekwoyi Zafnu nya. Ntulonu ənya n kwo laka n Urishelima n kwo lo kwoi shegwnu laɓa n Ilirukwum nyi, mi kwu Kirisiti nabagyi manai waazizhni n nunui. <verse eid="ROM 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 15:20" />Əmi ɓəmwi nu ciici ma zhni waazi nabagyi manai nya n aba n a to ɓə shni Kirisiti yekpé m, nabai ń mi taa gnyi mii mi ənya tu ń zado shnipa m. <verse eid="ROM 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 15:21" />N kwa cecelonu, ngye shi kwo kafyilo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:21">“Aza yi ń a to ɓə gna ɓa əwo ɓo nyi m, ɓa ɓə gyewye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:21">jesnu aza yi n ɓa to ɓə wo m, ɓa ɓə ɓwa awyega.”<verse eid="ROM 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 15:22" />Ciici əɓo ye nu kpma mi əfye aba ɓeɓe.<verse eid="ROM 15:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bwulus ɓəmwushi wa lo aza gnaɓyi n Roma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 15:23" />Ama nsaiye, she aba to yee lo ntuge ma zhni tnutnu n əknyisəpa ye nyi m, jesnu shikwonyi mi kwu aye bəgyé ɓwa awyeikwo mi ma ɓe fye gnaɓyi. <verse eid="ROM 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 15:24" />Mi n ɓəyei mwushi lo mii zhni lonu əsa n mi ɓə lo Asbaniya nyi. Mi n awyetui lo mii gye fye əwye əsa ń mi ɓə duya ncei n əfye aba jesnu fyei bma mi zhni n əmi znazna, mii kwu agbmada wo əmi dnadna nya n fyei əsa fyewyi. <verse eid="ROM 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 15:25" />Dudulonu nsaiye, mi la gbmidna n zokwo mii lo Urishelima mii zhni Dagayi aza tnutnu ń abaayi. <verse eid="ROM 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 15:26" />Ntuge Makidoninya n Akaiyai ɓə kwu agbmada wu, əsa n ɓa ɓə ga bmazhni ntu n Dagayi aza awyekwoyi ɓo n ɓa fyi n Urishelima nyi. <verse eid="ROM 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 15:27" />A ɓə kwu ɓa da ɓa zhni kwo, jesnu ɓəhnihni ɓa n əkwo ətai shi ɓa lo. Ntuge ngye Abyedo ɓa kwu Ayahudiyi zafnu anabəlika ɓwa dna n əɓa ɓwa, a gye ɓa n ətai shi Ayahudiyi lo, ɓa gná əɓa anyaɓwa anyashishi nya n kwnusnu n ɓai. <verse eid="ROM 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 15:28" />Ntulonu shi mi ɓə lá pwo əmi tnutnu ye, jesnu mii gye nge ɓa la anyakwnukwnu ye gwo, mi ɓəə lo Asbaniya, mii bmá ma ɓe fye gnaɓyi. <verse eid="ROM 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 15:29" />Mi kpəlo nge she mi ɓə ɓe da fye, mi ɓə ɓe n Kirisiti anabəlika mwumwui nu n nunui.<verse eid="ROM 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 15:30" />Mi gyi fye əwye, əmi azaje n əmi amapwii, dna n əyi Dagayi Yeisu Kirisiti ɓədo n yeye Zafnu nyai, nge fye dnaɓwado n mii, dna n əmi snunutú, fyei zhniaduwa ga Shekwoyi ntu əmi ɓo. <verse eid="ROM 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 15:31" />Fye zhniaduwa ga Shekwoyi nge mi ɓaa pwo n Yahudiya atnavyiyi akwnu, njesnu nge anyakwnukwnu n mi ɓə lo ncei n Urishelima nyi, nge Dagayi aza ɓə gwo ɓa n agbmadai, <verse eid="ROM 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 15:32" />nabai n mi ɓə ɓe əfye aba n agbmadai dna ń Shekwoyi ɓəmwi, jesnu n dna əfye gwodo n fye ɓa ɓwa zhishni. <verse eid="ROM 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 15:33" />Shekwoyi n wo ga bwugbafu nyi, wo kwnusnu n fyei, əfye vnyanya. Amyi.<verse eid="ROM 15:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ROM 16" />
  <para style="s1">Əmihniɓwugyi aza gnaɓyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 16:1" />Mi tnu n əyi mapwii Fyibyi n əfye aba, dikin ikilisiya nya dna ń Kankiriya. <verse eid="ROM 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 16:2" />Mi gna fye ge fye gwo wo dna ń Dagayi, n zokwo ń kwo kwnuce lo n əwo azai, jesnu fya ga wo bmazhni dna n zokwo dəhodəhoi n wo ɓa ye n əfya aba, ntuge wo zhni aza bəgyé bmazhnii nu, ɓədo n əmihnii ɓe.<verse eid="ROM 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 16:3" />Fye ga Pirisila əmi gnaɓyi n Akwuilai, əmi atnutnu kwnuzhniyi dna n Kirisiti Yeisu. <verse eid="ROM 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 16:4" />Ɓa ɓə kwu əɓahni wyewyeyi mafyi ntu əmi ɓo. To ɓwasnu n əmi gbmanyi ɓo nu m, ama Abyedo aikilisiya vnyanya, ɓa dagbma lo ntu əɓa ɓo.<verse eid="ROM 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 16:5" />Fye kwu ikilisiya ɓyigna ga mi ce, ń kwo yezhi ń əɓa pwuwa nyi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 16:5">Fye kwu əmi nugwnudo yeyei Efyinatus ɓyigna ga mi, əwo nu ɓə kpmi Kirisiti abwiye-gwo dna n Asiya əknyi.<verse eid="ROM 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 16:6" />Fye kwu Mariyamwu ɓyigna ce, ń əwo nu ɓə zhni tnutnu n agwuiga ntu əfye ɓo nyi.<verse eid="ROM 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 16:7" />Fye kwu Andronikwus ɓyigna ga mi n Juninyai, əmi Ayahudiyi aje n ɓa ɓə kwu kwnufyi n mii n zhalu nyi. Ɓa kwnuwu lo fyi ń atnutnuloyi aje atasni, jesnu ɓa ɓə kwu vyi Kirisiti n əmi abye.<verse eid="ROM 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 16:8" />Fye kwu Ampyilayatus ɓyigna ga mi, əmi nugwnudo yeyei dna ń Dagayi.<verse eid="ROM 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 16:9" />Kwu Ubanus ɓyigna, əyi tnutnu kwnuzhniyi dna n Kirisiti, ɓədo n əmi nugwnudo yeyeyii Sitaci.<verse eid="ROM 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 16:10" />Fye ɓyi Apyeles əgna, əza n əwo gbenu n Kirisiti aba too shnado m.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 16:10">Fye ɓyi aza yi əgna n ɓa fyi n Arisitobwulus pwuwa nyi.<verse eid="ROM 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 16:11" />Fye kwu Hirodiyon ɓyigna, əmi Yahudiyi ədo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 16:11">Fye ɓyi aza yi əgna n ɓa fyi n Nasikwus pwuwa n ɓa fyilo ń Dagayi nyi.<verse eid="ROM 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 16:12" />Fye ɓyi Tirafyena əgna n Tirafosai, anyikwoza yi n ɓa ɓə zhni tnutnu n agwuiga dna n Dagayi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 16:12">Fye kwu əmi nugwnudo yeyei ɓyigna ga mi, Pasis, nyikwoza ye ɓə kwu tnutnu zhni n agwuiga dna ń Dagayi.<verse eid="ROM 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 16:13" />Fye ɓyi Rufusi əgna, əza knyiknyiyi dna n Dagayi, ɓədo n əwo əyai, n wo la zhni əmi əya ce nyi.<verse eid="ROM 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 16:14" />Fye ɓyi Asinkiritus əgna, Fyilegon, Hamis, Patorobas, Hamas, n əyi azajei azanugbai n anyikwozai n ɓa kwnusnu lo n ɓai nyi.<verse eid="ROM 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 16:15" />Fye kwu Fyilologwos ɓyigna ga mi, ɓədo n Juliyai, Narewus n əwo mapwii, n Olimpasii n Dagayi azai vnyanya n ɓa kwnusnu lo n ɓai.<verse eid="ROM 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 16:16" />Fye ɓyi aje əgna n ɓwadodna gyigyiyii.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 16:16">Ikilisiya vnyanya Kirisiti nya ɓa tnu lo n əɓa gnaɓyii.<verse eid="ROM 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 16:17" />Mi gyi fye əwye, əmi azaje n amapwuyii, nge fye kwu aza yi kawye n ɓa ɓe n ajegnai jesnu ɓai zhi aɓo n fye ɓa cebwonyi n əfya azokwo; n ɓa shnado shnashnai lo n nyawui n fye kwu kwo tumwi nyi. Fye la taya n ɓai. <verse eid="ROM 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 16:18" />Ntuge aza yi pya ta zhni əyi Dagayi Kirisiti tnutnu nu m, ama əɓahni ashakpe nya. N əɓa ɓəda dadayii n cici gyifyi nyai, ɓa dna aza kwoce n əɓa abwugba to fyiakala m. <verse eid="ROM 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 16:19" />Zahozahoyi ń kwu əfye ɓəgbetuvyi ɓo wo, ntulonu mi nya agbmada lo ntu əfye ɓo; ama mi ncei pmalo fyaa ce ntu əɓo ɓo n kwo bmya, jesnu fya kwu zhni atnaɓətuyi ń ɓənukwoi ɓo.<verse eid="ROM 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 16:20" />Əsa taa mwa m, Shekwoyi bwugbafu nya ɓa vyì Shetam ya zhi n əfye apita snuta.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ROM 16:20" />
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 16:20">Shebmyashi Dagayi Yeisu nya kwo kwnusnu n fyei.<verse eid="ROM 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 16:21" />Timoti, əmi tnutnu kwnuzhniyi, wo tnu fye lo n əwo gnaɓyii, n ɓwasnu she Lushos, Jason n Sosipatai ɓyi fye əgna lo nyi, əmi Ayahudiyi aje.<verse eid="ROM 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 16:22" />Əmi, Tashos, n əmi nu naa ka paka ye nyi, mi ɓyi fye əgna lo dna ń Dagayi.<verse eid="ROM 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 16:23" />Gayus, əza ń əmi n ikilisiyai vnyanya wo əwo azhiɓeyi gwogwo agbmada lo nyi, wo tnu fye gnaɓyi lo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 16:23">Irasitus, ń əwo nu zhni əzhiyaakwo aza bəgyé tnutnu ɓəfyednayi nyi, n əyi zadoi Kwatosu, ɓa tnu fye gnaɓyi lo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 16:23">[<verse eid="ROM 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 16:24" />Shebmyashi Yeisu Kirisiti nya kwo sase kwnusnu n fyei, əfye vnyanya. Amyi.]<verse eid="ROM 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 16:25" />Nsaiye, mi fyi fye n əza akwnu, n wo ɓa myi wa myi fye zhi, ngye she mi kwu da dna ń əmi nabagyi manai nyi, waazi n mi zhni ntu Yeisu Kirisiti ɓo, kwoi vyi ɓəwyegye asigyi nya, ń kwo ɓə ɓwushi aye bəgyé ń ɓa la duya nyi. <verse eid="ROM 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 16:26" />Ama nsaiye a la kwo kpeyawu jesnu a kwu kwo wu Abyedo vnyanya dna ń sheɓəgwognada əpakashi; shi Shekwoyi nyalonyalo nya ɓə ga ɓa əgbetu nyi, nabai abye vnyanya ɓa vyi əwo ɓəgbetu kwnunu, n ɓa fyilo n gaiciyaganunui nyi. <verse eid="ROM 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 16:27" />Latu n cicii zhni Shekwoyi gbmanyi wyemwada nya nu, nyalonyalo nya dna n Yeisu Kirisiti! Amyi.<verse eid="ROM 16:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 16" />
</usx>